window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/a469-91a36a028263c3b4.json"]={sha256:"91a36a028263c3b48189582a0b6068e9d2afe59603c82d304ba8b3719ea50575",value:{"id":"a469","title":"望遠鏡主鏡主動支撐","titleEn":"Active support of telescope primary mirrors","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以 VLT 8.2 m、175 mm 厚的 Zerodur 薄彎月主鏡與 150 支軸向致動器為主軸，理解為什麼薄鏡必須由力分佈定義面形，再把彎曲模態、仰角載重、溫度梯度、30 秒積分的 Shack–Hartmann 感測、查找表與力圖健康監測整合成可驗收的主動光學工程。","summaryEn":"Built around the VLT's 8.2 m, 175 mm thick Zerodur meniscus and its 150 axial actuators, this course shows why a thin mirror's figure must be defined by its force distribution, then integrates bending modes, elevation loads, thermal gradients, 30-second Shack–Hartmann sensing, look-up tables and force-map health monitoring into an acceptable active-optics engineering record.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-astronomical","subcategoryTitle":"天文儀器與科學感測器","subcategoryTitleEn":"Astronomical instrumentation and scientific sensors","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-astronomical","learningTags":["optics","optics-astronomical","telescope"],"architectureFamily":"telescope","architectureNodes":[["薄彎月主鏡","Thin meniscus primary"],["軸向致動器與荷重元","Axial actuators and load cells"],["側向支撐與鏡室","Lateral supports and mirror cell"],["Shack–Hartmann 波前感測器","Shack–Hartmann wavefront sensor"],["主動光學控制器與查找表","Active-optics controller and look-up tables"],["副鏡六軸平台","Secondary-mirror hexapod"]],"architectureEdges":[[1,0],[2,0],[0,3],[3,4],[4,1],[4,5]],"diagram":{"type":"telescope","labels":["薄彎月主鏡","軸向致動器與荷重元","側向支撐與鏡室","Shack–Hartmann 波前感測器","主動光學控制器與查找表"],"labelsEn":["Thin meniscus primary","Axial actuators and load cells","Lateral supports and mirror cell","Shack–Hartmann wavefront sensor","Active-optics controller and look-up tables"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"主動修正練習：假設一面 8.2 m、175 mm 厚的 Zerodur 薄鏡位於天頂角 45°。鏡重 226 kN，軸向分量 226 × cos 45° ≈ 160 kN，150 支平均每支約 1,065 N，側向同為約 160 kN。夜間鏡體穿厚度溫差 0.4 K、α = 0.05 ppm/K：κ = 0.05×10⁻⁶ × 0.4/0.175 ≈ 1.14×10⁻⁷ m⁻¹，矢高 κa²/2 = 1.14×10⁻⁷ × 4.1²/2 ≈ 0.96 µm，交給副鏡以離焦修正。感測器量得像散係數 600 nm，主鏡迴路增益 0.3、每 45 s 修正一次，要降到 40 nm 需 n = ln(40/600)/ln(0.7) ≈ 7.6，即 8 次、約 6 分鐘。殘差預算為拋光 30、印痕 15、主動 25、熱 20、風 15 nm，RSS ≈ 49 nm，在 1.0 µm 的 Strehl ≈ exp[−(2π × 49/1000)²] ≈ 0.91。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實機規格。","textEn":"Active-correction exercise: assume an 8.2 m, 175 mm thick Zerodur meniscus at 45° zenith angle. The 226 kN weight has an axial component of 226 × cos 45° ≈ 160 kN, about 1,065 N on average for each of 150 actuators, and a lateral component of about 160 kN as well. At night a 0.4 K through-thickness difference with α = 0.05 ppm/K gives κ = 0.05×10⁻⁶ × 0.4/0.175 ≈ 1.14×10⁻⁷ m⁻¹ and a sag of κa²/2 = 1.14×10⁻⁷ × 4.1²/2 ≈ 0.96 µm, which the secondary removes as defocus. The sensor reports 600 nm of astigmatism; with gain 0.3 and one correction every 45 s, reaching 40 nm needs n = ln(40/600)/ln(0.7) ≈ 7.6, so 8 corrections or about 6 minutes. A residual budget of polishing 30, print-through 15, active 25, thermal 20 and wind 15 nm gives RSS ≈ 49 nm and Strehl ≈ exp[−(2π × 49/1000)²] ≈ 0.91 at 1.0 µm. Values are teaching assumptions, not any telescope's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a469-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「薄彎月主鏡的質量、剛性與重力變形」與「主動光學原理：模態剛性與低頻修正」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Mass, stiffness and gravity sag of a thin meniscus\" and \"Active-optics principle: modal stiffness and slow correction\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a469-v12-01","title":"薄彎月主鏡的質量、剛性與重力變形：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Mass, stiffness and gravity sag of a thin meniscus: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「8.2 m 薄彎月鏡坯」如何決定望遠鏡主鏡主動支撐的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “8.2 m thin meniscus blank” determines the key performance of “Active support of telescope primary mirrors”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"傳統主鏡以約 1:6 的厚徑比維持剛性，但口徑放大到 8 m 時鏡坯會重達上百噸、熱時間常數長達數天，鏡室與望遠鏡結構都難以承受。VLT 改用直徑 8.2 m、厚 175 mm 的 Zerodur 薄彎月鏡，厚徑比約 1:47、質量約 23 噸；然而板的彎曲剛度 D = E·t³/(12(1 − ν²)) 隨厚度三次方下降，鏡面在自身重量下已無法保持形狀。主動支撐的出發點就是承認這面鏡子是軟的，改由支撐力的分佈來定義面形。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「8.2 m 薄彎月鏡坯」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Classical primaries keep their stiffness with a thickness-to-diameter ratio near 1:6, but at 8 m aperture such a blank would weigh well over a hundred tonnes with a thermal time constant of days, burdening both cell and telescope structure. The VLT instead uses an 8.2 m diameter, 175 mm thick Zerodur meniscus with an aspect ratio near 1:47 and a mass of about 23 tonnes; however the plate bending stiffness D = E·t³/(12(1 − ν²)) falls with the cube of thickness, so the mirror can no longer hold its shape under its own weight. Active support starts by accepting that the mirror is soft and letting the distribution of support forces define its figure. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “8.2 m thin meniscus blank”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：Zerodur E = 90.3 GPa、ν = 0.243、ρ = 2530 kg/m³、t = 0.175 m：D ≈ 4.29×10⁷ N·m，自重面載 q = ρ·g·t ≈ 4,340 Pa。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For Zerodur with E = 90.3 GPa, ν = 0.243, ρ = 2530 kg/m³ and t = 0.175 m, D ≈ 4.29×10⁷ N·m and the self-weight pressure is q = ρ·g·t ≈ 4,340 Pa.","failure":"常見誤解：「主鏡越厚越好，薄鏡只是為了省錢而犧牲品質。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Thicker primaries are always better; thin mirrors merely trade quality for cost.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「8.2 m 薄彎月鏡坯」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “8.2 m thin meniscus blank”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-01-k1","title":"薄彎月主鏡的質量、剛性與重力變形","titleEn":"Mass, stiffness and gravity sag of a thin meniscus","text":"傳統主鏡以約 1:6 的厚徑比維持剛性，但口徑放大到 8 m 時鏡坯會重達上百噸、熱時間常數長達數天，鏡室與望遠鏡結構都難以承受。VLT 改用直徑 8.2 m、厚 175 mm 的 Zerodur 薄彎月鏡，厚徑比約 1:47、質量約 23 噸；然而板的彎曲剛度 D = E·t³/(12(1 − ν²)) 隨厚度三次方下降，鏡面在自身重量下已無法保持形狀。","textEn":"Classical primaries keep their stiffness with a thickness-to-diameter ratio near 1:6, but at 8 m aperture such a blank would weigh well over a hundred tonnes with a thermal time constant of days, burdening both cell and telescope structure. The VLT instead uses an 8.2 m diameter, 175 mm thick Zerodur meniscus with an aspect ratio near 1:47 and a mass of about 23 tonnes; however the plate bending stiffness D = E·t³/(12(1 − ν²)) falls with the cube of thickness, so the mirror can no longer hold its shape under its own weight.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：主鏡越厚越好，薄鏡只是為了省錢而犧牲品質。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Thicker primaries are always better; thin mirrors merely trade quality for cost. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「薄彎月主鏡的質量、剛性與重力變形」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Mass, stiffness and gravity sag of a thin meniscus\" is correct?","options":["主鏡越厚越好，薄鏡只是為了省錢而犧牲品質。","傳統主鏡以約 1:6 的厚徑比維持剛性，但口徑放大到 8 m 時鏡坯會重達上百噸、熱時間常數長達數天，鏡室與望遠鏡結構都難以承受。","主動光學和自適應光學一樣，可以即時修正大氣湍流。"],"optionsEn":["Thicker primaries are always better; thin mirrors merely trade quality for cost.","Classical primaries keep their stiffness with a thickness-to-diameter ratio near 1:6, but at 8 m aperture such a blank would weigh well over a hundred tonnes with a thermal time constant of days, burdening both cell and telescope structure.","Active optics, like adaptive optics, corrects atmospheric turbulence in real time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"傳統主鏡以約 1:6 的厚徑比維持剛性，但口徑放大到 8 m 時鏡坯會重達上百噸、熱時間常數長達數天，鏡室與望遠鏡結構都難以承受。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Classical primaries keep their stiffness with a thickness-to-diameter ratio near 1:6, but at 8 m aperture such a blank would weigh well over a hundred tonnes with a thermal time constant of days, burdening both cell and telescope structure. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a469-v12-02","title":"薄彎月主鏡的質量、剛性與重力變形：定量估算","titleEn":"Mass, stiffness and gravity sag of a thin meniscus: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「8.2 m 薄彎月鏡坯」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “8.2 m thin meniscus blank” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：Zerodur E = 90.3 GPa、ν = 0.243、ρ = 2530 kg/m³、t = 0.175 m：D ≈ 4.29×10⁷ N·m，自重面載 q = ρ·g·t ≈ 4,340 Pa。若只在外緣簡支，中心撓度 w = (5 + ν)·q·a⁴/(64(1 + ν)·D) ≈ 1.9 mm（a = 4.1 m）；同口徑做成 1.37 m 厚（1:6）只撓 0.031 mm，但質量達 183 噸。改用 150 點支撐，每點分攤約 0.35 m²、跨距約 0.59 m，撓度隨跨距四次方縮小 (0.59/8.2)⁴ ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁵，量級降到數十 nm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For Zerodur with E = 90.3 GPa, ν = 0.243, ρ = 2530 kg/m³ and t = 0.175 m, D ≈ 4.29×10⁷ N·m and the self-weight pressure is q = ρ·g·t ≈ 4,340 Pa. Simply supported only at the rim, the centre deflection w = (5 + ν)·q·a⁴/(64(1 + ν)·D) ≈ 1.9 mm for a = 4.1 m; the same aperture at 1.37 m thickness (1:6) sags only 0.031 mm but weighs 183 tonnes. With 150 supports each carrying about 0.35 m² over a span near 0.59 m, deflection scales down with the fourth power of span, (0.59/8.2)⁴ ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁵, to the order of tens of nanometres. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以有限元素模型計算鏡坯在 150 點支撐、不同仰角下的面形，與上式的量級互相核對；在拋光廠以與望遠鏡相同佈局的 150 點測試支撐量面形，再到望遠鏡上以波前感測器量重力變形殘差，三者一致才代表支撐模型可信。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compute the blank's figure on 150 supports at several elevations with a finite-element model and cross-check the order of magnitude against the formula; measure the figure in the polishing shop on a 150-point test support matching the telescope layout, then measure the gravity residual on the telescope with the wavefront sensor; only when all three agree is the support model trustworthy.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"Zerodur E = 90.3 GPa、ν = 0.243、ρ = 2530 kg/m³、t = 0.175 m：D ≈ 4.29×10⁷ N·m，自重面載 q = ρ·g·t ≈ 4,340 Pa。若只在外緣簡支，中心撓度 w = (5 + ν)·q·a⁴/(64(1 + ν)·D) ≈ 1.9 mm（a = 4.1 m）；同口徑做成 1.37 m 厚（1:6）只撓 0.031 mm，但質量達 183 噸。改用 150 點支撐，每點分攤約 0.35 m²、跨距約 0.59 m，撓度隨跨距四次方縮小 (0.59/8.2)⁴ ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁵，量級降到數十 nm。","textEn":"For Zerodur with E = 90.3 GPa, ν = 0.243, ρ = 2530 kg/m³ and t = 0.175 m, D ≈ 4.29×10⁷ N·m and the self-weight pressure is q = ρ·g·t ≈ 4,340 Pa. Simply supported only at the rim, the centre deflection w = (5 + ν)·q·a⁴/(64(1 + ν)·D) ≈ 1.9 mm for a = 4.1 m; the same aperture at 1.37 m thickness (1:6) sags only 0.031 mm but weighs 183 tonnes. With 150 supports each carrying about 0.35 m² over a span near 0.59 m, deflection scales down with the fourth power of span, (0.59/8.2)⁴ ≈ 2.7×10⁻⁵, to the order of tens of nanometres.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「薄彎月主鏡的質量、剛性與重力變形」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Mass, stiffness and gravity sag of a thin meniscus\", which statement holds?","options":["使用低膨脹的 Zerodur 後，主鏡就不需要任何熱控制。","致動器越多、修正的模態越多，殘差就一定越小。","Zerodur E = 90.3 GPa、ν = 0.243、ρ = 2530 kg/m³、t = 0.175 m：D ≈ 4.29×10⁷ N·m，自重面載 q = ρ·g·t ≈ 4,340 Pa。"],"optionsEn":["With low-expansion Zerodur the primary needs no thermal control at all.","More actuators and more corrected modes always mean smaller residuals.","For Zerodur with E = 90.3 GPa, ν = 0.243, ρ = 2530 kg/m³ and t = 0.175 m, D ≈ 4.29×10⁷ N·m and the self-weight pressure is q = ρ·g·t ≈ 4,340 Pa."],"answer":2,"explanation":"Zerodur E = 90.3 GPa、ν = 0.243、ρ = 2530 kg/m³、t = 0.175 m：D ≈ 4.29×10⁷ N·m，自重面載 q = ρ·g·t ≈ 4,340 Pa。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For Zerodur with E = 90.3 GPa, ν = 0.243, ρ = 2530 kg/m³ and t = 0.175 m, D ≈ 4.29×10⁷ N·m and the self-weight pressure is q = ρ·g·t ≈ 4,340 Pa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a469-v12-03","title":"薄彎月主鏡的質量、剛性與重力變形：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Mass, stiffness and gravity sag of a thin meniscus: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「8.2 m 薄彎月鏡坯」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “8.2 m thin meniscus blank” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以有限元素模型計算鏡坯在 150 點支撐、不同仰角下的面形，與上式的量級互相核對；在拋光廠以與望遠鏡相同佈局的 150 點測試支撐量面形，再到望遠鏡上以波前感測器量重力變形殘差，三者一致才代表支撐模型可信。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compute the blank's figure on 150 supports at several elevations with a finite-element model and cross-check the order of magnitude against the formula; measure the figure in the polishing shop on a 150-point test support matching the telescope layout, then measure the gravity residual on the telescope with the wavefront sensor; only when all three agree is the support model trustworthy. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若把薄鏡當成剛體，只用少數硬點支撐或夾持，鏡面在重力下產生毫米級變形與強烈像散，影像完全失焦；即使支撐點數足夠，只要某一區的力分配錯誤，該區就會留下數百 nm 的局部凹陷。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Treating the thin mirror as rigid and holding it on a few hard points or clamps produces millimetre-scale gravity deformation and severe astigmatism, defocusing the image entirely; even with enough supports, a wrong force allocation in one zone leaves a local depression of hundreds of nanometres there.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以有限元素模型計算鏡坯在 150 點支撐、不同仰角下的面形，與上式的量級互相核對；在拋光廠以與望遠鏡相同佈局的 150 點測試支撐量面形，再到望遠鏡上以波前感測器量重力變形殘差，三者一致才代表支撐模型可信。","textEn":"Compute the blank's figure on 150 supports at several elevations with a finite-element model and cross-check the order of magnitude against the formula; measure the figure in the polishing shop on a 150-point test support matching the telescope layout, then measure the gravity residual on the telescope with the wavefront sensor; only when all three agree is the support model trustworthy.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「薄彎月主鏡的質量、剛性與重力變形」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Mass, stiffness and gravity sag of a thin meniscus\"?","options":["以有限元素模型計算鏡坯在 150 點支撐、不同仰角下的面形，與上式的量級互相核對。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","只要有閉迴路修正，開迴路查找表就沒有用處。"],"optionsEn":["Compute the blank's figure on 150 supports at several elevations with a finite-element model and cross-check the order of magnitude against the formula.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","With closed-loop correction available, open-loop look-up tables are useless."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以有限元素模型計算鏡坯在 150 點支撐、不同仰角下的面形，與上式的量級互相核對；在拋光廠以與望遠鏡相同佈局的 150 點測試支撐量面形，再到望遠鏡上以波前感測器量重力變形殘差，三者一致才代表支撐模型可信。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compute the blank's figure on 150 supports at several elevations with a finite-element model and cross-check the order of magnitude against the formula; measure the figure in the polishing shop on a 150-point test support matching the telescope layout, then measure the gravity residual on the telescope with the wavefront sensor; only when all three agree is the support model trustworthy. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a469-v12-04","title":"薄彎月主鏡的質量、剛性與重力變形：失效診斷","titleEn":"Mass, stiffness and gravity sag of a thin meniscus: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「8.2 m 薄彎月鏡坯」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “8.2 m thin meniscus blank” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若把薄鏡當成剛體，只用少數硬點支撐或夾持，鏡面在重力下產生毫米級變形與強烈像散，影像完全失焦；即使支撐點數足夠，只要某一區的力分配錯誤，該區就會留下數百 nm 的局部凹陷。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Treating the thin mirror as rigid and holding it on a few hard points or clamps produces millimetre-scale gravity deformation and severe astigmatism, defocusing the image entirely; even with enough supports, a wrong force allocation in one zone leaves a local depression of hundreds of nanometres there. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：主動支撐的出發點就是承認這面鏡子是軟的，改由支撐力的分佈來定義面形。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Active support starts by accepting that the mirror is soft and letting the distribution of support forces define its figure.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「主鏡越厚越好，薄鏡只是為了省錢而犧牲品質。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Thicker primaries are always better; thin mirrors merely trade quality for cost.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若把薄鏡當成剛體，只用少數硬點支撐或夾持，鏡面在重力下產生毫米級變形與強烈像散，影像完全失焦；即使支撐點數足夠，只要某一區的力分配錯誤，該區就會留下數百 nm 的局部凹陷。","textEn":"Treating the thin mirror as rigid and holding it on a few hard points or clamps produces millimetre-scale gravity deformation and severe astigmatism, defocusing the image entirely; even with enough supports, a wrong force allocation in one zone leaves a local depression of hundreds of nanometres there.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「薄彎月主鏡的質量、剛性與重力變形」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Mass, stiffness and gravity sag of a thin meniscus\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","若把薄鏡當成剛體，只用少數硬點支撐或夾持，鏡面在重力下產生毫米級變形與強烈像散，影像完全失焦。","主動光學和自適應光學一樣，可以即時修正大氣湍流。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Treating the thin mirror as rigid and holding it on a few hard points or clamps produces millimetre-scale gravity deformation and severe astigmatism, defocusing the image entirely.","Active optics, like adaptive optics, corrects atmospheric turbulence in real time."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若把薄鏡當成剛體，只用少數硬點支撐或夾持，鏡面在重力下產生毫米級變形與強烈像散，影像完全失焦；即使支撐點數足夠，只要某一區的力分配錯誤，該區就會留下數百 nm 的局部凹陷。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Treating the thin mirror as rigid and holding it on a few hard points or clamps produces millimetre-scale gravity deformation and severe astigmatism, defocusing the image entirely; even with enough supports, a wrong force allocation in one zone leaves a local depression of hundreds of nanometres there. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a469-v12-05","title":"主動光學原理：模態剛性與低頻修正：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Active-optics principle: modal stiffness and slow correction: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「彎曲模態與修正力分佈」如何決定望遠鏡主鏡主動支撐的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Bending modes and correction-force patterns” determines the key performance of “Active support of telescope primary mirrors”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"主動光學以約每分鐘一次的節奏修正緩慢變化的像差，包括隨仰角改變的重力變形、溫度梯度、拋光殘差與支撐誤差，而不是修正大氣湍流。把鏡面變形展開成自由圓板的彎曲模態最有效率，因為每個模態有各自的剛性：像散與三葉形等低階模態最軟，只需小力就能修正，高階模態所需的力則隨階數迅速增加。因此主動光學只修前十到二十個模態，更高階的誤差必須在拋光階段就做好；VLT 另把離焦與彗差交給副鏡的位置修正。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「彎曲模態與修正力分佈」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Active optics corrects slowly varying aberrations at roughly one update per minute, including elevation-dependent gravity deformation, thermal gradients, polishing residuals and support errors, not atmospheric turbulence. Expanding the deformation in the bending modes of a free circular plate is most efficient because each mode has its own stiffness: low-order modes such as astigmatism and trefoil are softest and need little force, while the force needed rises steeply with mode order. Active optics therefore corrects only the first ten to twenty modes, higher orders must be polished out, and the VLT hands defocus and coma to secondary-mirror position control. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Bending modes and correction-force patterns”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：自由圓板固有頻率 f = λ²/(2πa²)·√(D/(ρt))；以 ν ≈ 0.33 的特徵值 λ² ≈ 5.25（像散）、9.08（軸對稱）、12.2（三葉形）、21.6（四葉形）與 √(D/(ρt)) ≈ 311 m²/s 代入，得約 15、27、36、64 Hz。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Free-plate natural frequencies are f = λ²/(2πa²)·√(D/(ρt)); with ν ≈ 0.33 eigenvalues λ² ≈ 5.25 (astigmatism), 9.08 (axisymmetric), 12.2 (trefoil) and 21.6 (quadrafoil) and √(D/(ρt)) ≈ 311 m²/s, they are about 15, 27, 36 and 64 Hz.","failure":"常見誤解：「主動光學和自適應光學一樣，可以即時修正大氣湍流。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Active optics, like adaptive optics, corrects atmospheric turbulence in real time.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「彎曲模態與修正力分佈」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Bending modes and correction-force patterns”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-05-k1","title":"主動光學原理：模態剛性與低頻修正","titleEn":"Active-optics principle: modal stiffness and slow correction","text":"主動光學以約每分鐘一次的節奏修正緩慢變化的像差，包括隨仰角改變的重力變形、溫度梯度、拋光殘差與支撐誤差，而不是修正大氣湍流。把鏡面變形展開成自由圓板的彎曲模態最有效率，因為每個模態有各自的剛性：像散與三葉形等低階模態最軟，只需小力就能修正，高階模態所需的力則隨階數迅速增加。","textEn":"Active optics corrects slowly varying aberrations at roughly one update per minute, including elevation-dependent gravity deformation, thermal gradients, polishing residuals and support errors, not atmospheric turbulence. Expanding the deformation in the bending modes of a free circular plate is most efficient because each mode has its own stiffness: low-order modes such as astigmatism and trefoil are softest and need little force, while the force needed rises steeply with mode order.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：主動光學和自適應光學一樣，可以即時修正大氣湍流。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Active optics, like adaptive optics, corrects atmospheric turbulence in real time. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「主動光學原理：模態剛性與低頻修正」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Active-optics principle: modal stiffness and slow correction\" is correct?","options":["主動光學和自適應光學一樣，可以即時修正大氣湍流。","主鏡致動器只要把位置控制到奈米級，力的大小無關緊要。","主動光學以約每分鐘一次的節奏修正緩慢變化的像差，包括隨仰角改變的重力變形、溫度梯度、拋光殘差與支撐誤差，而不是修正大氣湍流。"],"optionsEn":["Active optics, like adaptive optics, corrects atmospheric turbulence in real time.","Primary-mirror actuators need only nanometre position control; force does not matter.","Active optics corrects slowly varying aberrations at roughly one update per minute, including elevation-dependent gravity deformation, thermal gradients, polishing residuals and support errors, not atmospheric turbulence."],"answer":2,"explanation":"主動光學以約每分鐘一次的節奏修正緩慢變化的像差，包括隨仰角改變的重力變形、溫度梯度、拋光殘差與支撐誤差，而不是修正大氣湍流。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Active optics corrects slowly varying aberrations at roughly one update per minute, including elevation-dependent gravity deformation, thermal gradients, polishing residuals and support errors, not atmospheric turbulence. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a469-v12-06","title":"主動光學原理：模態剛性與低頻修正：定量估算","titleEn":"Active-optics principle: modal stiffness and slow correction: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「彎曲模態與修正力分佈」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Bending modes and correction-force patterns” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：自由圓板固有頻率 f = λ²/(2πa²)·√(D/(ρt))；以 ν ≈ 0.33 的特徵值 λ² ≈ 5.25（像散）、9.08（軸對稱）、12.2（三葉形）、21.6（四葉形）與 √(D/(ρt)) ≈ 311 m²/s 代入，得約 15、27、36、64 Hz。模態剛性 ∝ ω²，同振幅下三葉形所需力約為像散的 (12.2/5.25)² ≈ 5.4 倍、四葉形約 17 倍；若 ±120 N 力預算能修 1 µm 像散（教學假設），同樣力只修約 0.18 µm 三葉形或 0.06 µm 四葉形。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Free-plate natural frequencies are f = λ²/(2πa²)·√(D/(ρt)); with ν ≈ 0.33 eigenvalues λ² ≈ 5.25 (astigmatism), 9.08 (axisymmetric), 12.2 (trefoil) and 21.6 (quadrafoil) and √(D/(ρt)) ≈ 311 m²/s, they are about 15, 27, 36 and 64 Hz. Modal stiffness scales as ω², so at equal amplitude trefoil needs about (12.2/5.25)² ≈ 5.4 times the force of astigmatism and quadrafoil about 17 times; if a ±120 N budget corrects 1 µm of astigmatism (teaching assumption), the same force corrects only about 0.18 µm of trefoil or 0.06 µm of quadrafoil. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在鏡上逐一對單支致動器施加已知力變化，以干涉儀或波前感測器量其響應，建立影響函數矩陣；對矩陣做奇異值分解，確認奇異向量的形狀與彎曲模態相符、奇異值隨模態階數遞減，並依此決定要納入控制的模態數。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Apply a known force change to one actuator at a time and measure the response with an interferometer or the wavefront sensor to build the influence-function matrix; take its singular-value decomposition, confirm that the singular vectors resemble the bending modes and that singular values fall with mode order, and use this to decide how many modes enter the control.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"自由圓板固有頻率 f = λ²/(2πa²)·√(D/(ρt))；以 ν ≈ 0.33 的特徵值 λ² ≈ 5.25（像散）、9.08（軸對稱）、12.2（三葉形）、21.6（四葉形）與 √(D/(ρt)) ≈ 311 m²/s 代入，得約 15、27、36、64 Hz。模態剛性 ∝ ω²，同振幅下三葉形所需力約為像散的 (12.2/5.25)² ≈ 5.4 倍、四葉形約 17 倍；若 ±120 N 力預算能修 1 µm 像散（教學假設），同樣力只修約 0.18 µm 三葉形或 0.06 µm 四葉形。","textEn":"Free-plate natural frequencies are f = λ²/(2πa²)·√(D/(ρt)); with ν ≈ 0.33 eigenvalues λ² ≈ 5.25 (astigmatism), 9.08 (axisymmetric), 12.2 (trefoil) and 21.6 (quadrafoil) and √(D/(ρt)) ≈ 311 m²/s, they are about 15, 27, 36 and 64 Hz. Modal stiffness scales as ω², so at equal amplitude trefoil needs about (12.2/5.25)² ≈ 5.4 times the force of astigmatism and quadrafoil about 17 times; if a ±120 N budget corrects 1 µm of astigmatism (teaching assumption), the same force corrects only about 0.18 µm of trefoil or 0.06 µm of quadrafoil.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「主動光學原理：模態剛性與低頻修正」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Active-optics principle: modal stiffness and slow correction\", which statement holds?","options":["自由圓板固有頻率 f = λ²/(2πa²)·√(D/(ρt))。","主動光學感測器量得越快越好，曝光一秒就足夠。","只要有閉迴路修正，開迴路查找表就沒有用處。"],"optionsEn":["Free-plate natural frequencies are f = λ²/(2πa²)·√(D/(ρt)).","Faster is always better for the active-optics sensor; one-second exposures suffice.","With closed-loop correction available, open-loop look-up tables are useless."],"answer":0,"explanation":"自由圓板固有頻率 f = λ²/(2πa²)·√(D/(ρt))；以 ν ≈ 0.33 的特徵值 λ² ≈ 5.25（像散）、9.08（軸對稱）、12.2（三葉形）、21.6（四葉形）與 √(D/(ρt)) ≈ 311 m²/s 代入，得約 15、27、36、64 Hz。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Free-plate natural frequencies are f = λ²/(2πa²)·√(D/(ρt)); with ν ≈ 0.33 eigenvalues λ² ≈ 5.25 (astigmatism), 9.08 (axisymmetric), 12.2 (trefoil) and 21.6 (quadrafoil) and √(D/(ρt)) ≈ 311 m²/s, they are about 15, 27, 36 and 64 Hz. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a469-v12-07","title":"主動光學原理：模態剛性與低頻修正：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Active-optics principle: modal stiffness and slow correction: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「彎曲模態與修正力分佈」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Bending modes and correction-force patterns” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在鏡上逐一對單支致動器施加已知力變化，以干涉儀或波前感測器量其響應，建立影響函數矩陣；對矩陣做奇異值分解，確認奇異向量的形狀與彎曲模態相符、奇異值隨模態階數遞減，並依此決定要納入控制的模態數。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Apply a known force change to one actuator at a time and measure the response with an interferometer or the wavefront sensor to build the influence-function matrix; take its singular-value decomposition, confirm that the singular vectors resemble the bending modes and that singular values fall with mode order, and use this to decide how many modes enter the control. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若控制器試圖修正高階模態，所需的力會超出致動器範圍或讓少數致動器飽和，並把量測雜訊放大成局部力尖峰，鏡面反而出現新的高頻殘差；若把湍流當成修正對象而縮短積分時間，同樣會把大氣雜訊寫進鏡面。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If the controller tries to correct high-order modes, the required forces exceed actuator range or saturate a few actuators and amplify measurement noise into local force spikes, leaving new high-frequency residuals on the mirror; shortening integration to chase turbulence likewise writes atmospheric noise into the figure.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在鏡上逐一對單支致動器施加已知力變化，以干涉儀或波前感測器量其響應，建立影響函數矩陣；對矩陣做奇異值分解，確認奇異向量的形狀與彎曲模態相符、奇異值隨模態階數遞減，並依此決定要納入控制的模態數。","textEn":"Apply a known force change to one actuator at a time and measure the response with an interferometer or the wavefront sensor to build the influence-function matrix; take its singular-value decomposition, confirm that the singular vectors resemble the bending modes and that singular values fall with mode order, and use this to decide how many modes enter the control.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「主動光學原理：模態剛性與低頻修正」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Active-optics principle: modal stiffness and slow correction\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","在鏡上逐一對單支致動器施加已知力變化，以干涉儀或波前感測器量其響應，建立影響函數矩陣。","只要影像品質合格，主鏡支撐系統就一定健康。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Apply a known force change to one actuator at a time and measure the response with an interferometer or the wavefront sensor to build the influence-function matrix.","If image quality passes, the primary support system must be healthy."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在鏡上逐一對單支致動器施加已知力變化，以干涉儀或波前感測器量其響應，建立影響函數矩陣；對矩陣做奇異值分解，確認奇異向量的形狀與彎曲模態相符、奇異值隨模態階數遞減，並依此決定要納入控制的模態數。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Apply a known force change to one actuator at a time and measure the response with an interferometer or the wavefront sensor to build the influence-function matrix; take its singular-value decomposition, confirm that the singular vectors resemble the bending modes and that singular values fall with mode order, and use this to decide how many modes enter the control. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a469-v12-08","title":"主動光學原理：模態剛性與低頻修正：失效診斷","titleEn":"Active-optics principle: modal stiffness and slow correction: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「彎曲模態與修正力分佈」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Bending modes and correction-force patterns” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若控制器試圖修正高階模態，所需的力會超出致動器範圍或讓少數致動器飽和，並把量測雜訊放大成局部力尖峰，鏡面反而出現新的高頻殘差；若把湍流當成修正對象而縮短積分時間，同樣會把大氣雜訊寫進鏡面。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If the controller tries to correct high-order modes, the required forces exceed actuator range or saturate a few actuators and amplify measurement noise into local force spikes, leaving new high-frequency residuals on the mirror; shortening integration to chase turbulence likewise writes atmospheric noise into the figure. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：因此主動光學只修前十到二十個模態，更高階的誤差必須在拋光階段就做好；VLT 另把離焦與彗差交給副鏡的位置修正。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Active optics therefore corrects only the first ten to twenty modes, higher orders must be polished out, and the VLT hands defocus and coma to secondary-mirror position control.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「主動光學和自適應光學一樣，可以即時修正大氣湍流。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Active optics, like adaptive optics, corrects atmospheric turbulence in real time.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若控制器試圖修正高階模態，所需的力會超出致動器範圍或讓少數致動器飽和，並把量測雜訊放大成局部力尖峰，鏡面反而出現新的高頻殘差；若把湍流當成修正對象而縮短積分時間，同樣會把大氣雜訊寫進鏡面。","textEn":"If the controller tries to correct high-order modes, the required forces exceed actuator range or saturate a few actuators and amplify measurement noise into local force spikes, leaving new high-frequency residuals on the mirror; shortening integration to chase turbulence likewise writes atmospheric noise into the figure.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「主動光學原理：模態剛性與低頻修正」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Active-optics principle: modal stiffness and slow correction\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","主鏡致動器只要把位置控制到奈米級，力的大小無關緊要。","若控制器試圖修正高階模態，所需的力會超出致動器範圍或讓少數致動器飽和，並把量測雜訊放大成局部力尖峰，鏡面反而出現新的高頻殘差。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Primary-mirror actuators need only nanometre position control; force does not matter.","If the controller tries to correct high-order modes, the required forces exceed actuator range or saturate a few actuators and amplify measurement noise into local force spikes, leaving new high-frequency residuals on the mirror."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若控制器試圖修正高階模態，所需的力會超出致動器範圍或讓少數致動器飽和，並把量測雜訊放大成局部力尖峰，鏡面反而出現新的高頻殘差；若把湍流當成修正對象而縮短積分時間，同樣會把大氣雜訊寫進鏡面。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the controller tries to correct high-order modes, the required forces exceed actuator range or saturate a few actuators and amplify measurement noise into local force spikes, leaving new high-frequency residuals on the mirror; shortening integration to chase turbulence likewise writes atmospheric noise into the figure. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a469-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「軸向支撐：力分配、仰角載重與力精度」與「側向支撐、溫度梯度與鏡面熱慣性」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Axial support: force distribution, elevation load and force accuracy\" and \"Lateral support, thermal gradients and mirror thermal inertia\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a469-v12-09","title":"軸向支撐：力分配、仰角載重與力精度：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Axial support: force distribution, elevation load and force accuracy: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「150 支軸向致動器與荷重元」如何決定望遠鏡主鏡主動支撐的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “150 axial actuators and load cells” determines the key performance of “Active support of telescope primary mirrors”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"VLT 主鏡由 150 支電腦控制的軸向力致動器支撐，每支透過三腳架與 invar 墊（共 450 個）把力分散到鏡背，避免點載重在鏡面留下印痕。致動器同時承擔被動重量並疊加主動修正力，所以設計重點是力控制而非位置控制：鏡子的剛體位置由少數定義點或分區的被動系統決定，其餘致動器負責在該位置下提供正確的力分佈。仰角改變時軸向分量按 cos z 減少，力設定點必須連續追隨。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「150 支軸向致動器與荷重元」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The VLT primary rests on 150 computer-controlled axial force actuators, each spreading its load through a tripod and invar pads, 450 in total, so that point loads do not print through to the surface. The actuators carry the passive weight and add active correction forces on top, so the design emphasises force control rather than position control: the mirror's rigid-body position is fixed by a few defining points or passive zoned systems, and the remaining actuators supply the correct force distribution at that position. As elevation changes the axial component falls as cos z, and the force set points must follow continuously. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “150 axial actuators and load cells”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：鏡重 23.0 t，W ≈ 226 kN，天頂時平均每支 1,506 N；天頂角 30° 時軸向總載 196 kN（每支 1,305 N）、側向 113 kN；60° 時軸向 113 kN（每支 753 N）、側向 196 kN。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With a 23.0 t mirror, W ≈ 226 kN, an average of 1,506 N per actuator at zenith; at 30° zenith angle the axial load is 196 kN (1,305 N each) and the lateral load 113 kN; at 60° the axial load is 113 kN (753 N each) and the lateral 196 kN.","failure":"常見誤解：「主鏡致動器只要把位置控制到奈米級，力的大小無關緊要。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Primary-mirror actuators need only nanometre position control; force does not matter.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「150 支軸向致動器與荷重元」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “150 axial actuators and load cells”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-09-k1","title":"軸向支撐：力分配、仰角載重與力精度","titleEn":"Axial support: force distribution, elevation load and force accuracy","text":"VLT 主鏡由 150 支電腦控制的軸向力致動器支撐，每支透過三腳架與 invar 墊（共 450 個）把力分散到鏡背，避免點載重在鏡面留下印痕。致動器同時承擔被動重量並疊加主動修正力，所以設計重點是力控制而非位置控制：鏡子的剛體位置由少數定義點或分區的被動系統決定，其餘致動器負責在該位置下提供正確的力分佈。","textEn":"The VLT primary rests on 150 computer-controlled axial force actuators, each spreading its load through a tripod and invar pads, 450 in total, so that point loads do not print through to the surface. The actuators carry the passive weight and add active correction forces on top, so the design emphasises force control rather than position control: the mirror's rigid-body position is fixed by a few defining points or passive zoned systems, and the remaining actuators supply the correct force distribution at that position.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：主鏡致動器只要把位置控制到奈米級，力的大小無關緊要。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Primary-mirror actuators need only nanometre position control; force does not matter. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「軸向支撐：力分配、仰角載重與力精度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Axial support: force distribution, elevation load and force accuracy\" is correct?","options":["VLT 主鏡由 150 支電腦控制的軸向力致動器支撐，每支透過三腳架與 invar 墊（共 450 個）把力分散到鏡背，避免點載重在鏡面留下印痕。","主鏡致動器只要把位置控制到奈米級，力的大小無關緊要。","使用低膨脹的 Zerodur 後，主鏡就不需要任何熱控制。"],"optionsEn":["The VLT primary rests on 150 computer-controlled axial force actuators, each spreading its load through a tripod and invar pads, 450 in total, so that point loads do not print through to the surface.","Primary-mirror actuators need only nanometre position control; force does not matter.","With low-expansion Zerodur the primary needs no thermal control at all."],"answer":0,"explanation":"VLT 主鏡由 150 支電腦控制的軸向力致動器支撐，每支透過三腳架與 invar 墊（共 450 個）把力分散到鏡背，避免點載重在鏡面留下印痕。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The VLT primary rests on 150 computer-controlled axial force actuators, each spreading its load through a tripod and invar pads, 450 in total, so that point loads do not print through to the surface. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a469-v12-10","title":"軸向支撐：力分配、仰角載重與力精度：定量估算","titleEn":"Axial support: force distribution, elevation load and force accuracy: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「150 支軸向致動器與荷重元」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “150 axial actuators and load cells” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：鏡重 23.0 t，W ≈ 226 kN，天頂時平均每支 1,506 N；天頂角 30° 時軸向總載 196 kN（每支 1,305 N）、側向 113 kN；60° 時軸向 113 kN（每支 753 N）、側向 196 kN。ESO 為拋光殘差保留約 ±120 N 主動力，約為天頂被動載重的 8%；若要把力設定誤差壓在主動預算的 1% 以內，每支力精度需約 1 N 或更好。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With a 23.0 t mirror, W ≈ 226 kN, an average of 1,506 N per actuator at zenith; at 30° zenith angle the axial load is 196 kN (1,305 N each) and the lateral load 113 kN; at 60° the axial load is 113 kN (753 N each) and the lateral 196 kN. ESO reserves about ±120 N of active force for figuring errors, about 8% of the zenith passive load; keeping set-point errors within 1% of that active budget requires about 1 N force accuracy per actuator or better. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：每支致動器出廠前以標準荷重元校正力對指令的曲線與遲滯；安裝後做力總和檢查：各支量測力的總和扣除定義點分擔後必須等於 W·cos z，在多個仰角下記錄偏差，並長期追蹤每支的力值與模型預測之差。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before delivery calibrate each actuator's force-versus-command curve and hysteresis against a reference load cell; after installation perform force-sum checks in which the measured forces minus the share of the defining points must equal W·cos z, log the deviation at several elevations, and track each actuator's difference from the model over the long term.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"鏡重 23.0 t，W ≈ 226 kN，天頂時平均每支 1,506 N；天頂角 30° 時軸向總載 196 kN（每支 1,305 N）、側向 113 kN；60° 時軸向 113 kN（每支 753 N）、側向 196 kN。ESO 為拋光殘差保留約 ±120 N 主動力，約為天頂被動載重的 8%；若要把力設定誤差壓在主動預算的 1% 以內，每支力精度需約 1 N 或更好。","textEn":"With a 23.0 t mirror, W ≈ 226 kN, an average of 1,506 N per actuator at zenith; at 30° zenith angle the axial load is 196 kN (1,305 N each) and the lateral load 113 kN; at 60° the axial load is 113 kN (753 N each) and the lateral 196 kN. ESO reserves about ±120 N of active force for figuring errors, about 8% of the zenith passive load; keeping set-point errors within 1% of that active budget requires about 1 N force accuracy per actuator or better.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「軸向支撐：力分配、仰角載重與力精度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Axial support: force distribution, elevation load and force accuracy\", which statement holds?","options":["致動器越多、修正的模態越多，殘差就一定越小。","鏡重 23.0 t，W ≈ 226 kN，天頂時平均每支 1,506 N。","只要影像品質合格，主鏡支撐系統就一定健康。"],"optionsEn":["More actuators and more corrected modes always mean smaller residuals.","With a 23.0 t mirror, W ≈ 226 kN, an average of 1,506 N per actuator at zenith.","If image quality passes, the primary support system must be healthy."],"answer":1,"explanation":"鏡重 23.0 t，W ≈ 226 kN，天頂時平均每支 1,506 N；天頂角 30° 時軸向總載 196 kN（每支 1,305 N）、側向 113 kN；60° 時軸向 113 kN（每支 753 N）、側向 196 kN。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With a 23.0 t mirror, W ≈ 226 kN, an average of 1,506 N per actuator at zenith; at 30° zenith angle the axial load is 196 kN (1,305 N each) and the lateral load 113 kN; at 60° the axial load is 113 kN (753 N each) and the lateral 196 kN. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a469-v12-11","title":"軸向支撐：力分配、仰角載重與力精度：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Axial support: force distribution, elevation load and force accuracy: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「150 支軸向致動器與荷重元」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “150 axial actuators and load cells” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"每支致動器出廠前以標準荷重元校正力對指令的曲線與遲滯；安裝後做力總和檢查：各支量測力的總和扣除定義點分擔後必須等於 W·cos z，在多個仰角下記錄偏差，並長期追蹤每支的力值與模型預測之差。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before delivery calibrate each actuator's force-versus-command curve and hysteresis against a reference load cell; after installation perform force-sum checks in which the measured forces minus the share of the defining points must equal W·cos z, log the deviation at several elevations, and track each actuator's difference from the model over the long term. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：某支致動器的荷重元零點漂移 20 N 而未被發現，控制器以為力正確，鏡面在該處留下局部凸起，影像外圍出現不對稱光暈；若力總和與定義點載重持續偏離，代表有機械卡滯或定義點過載。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A load-cell zero drift of 20 N on one actuator goes unnoticed, the controller believes the force is correct, and the mirror develops a local bump there that shows up as an asymmetric halo around images; a persistent mismatch between the force sum and the defining-point loads signals mechanical sticking or an overloaded defining point.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每支致動器出廠前以標準荷重元校正力對指令的曲線與遲滯；安裝後做力總和檢查：各支量測力的總和扣除定義點分擔後必須等於 W·cos z，在多個仰角下記錄偏差，並長期追蹤每支的力值與模型預測之差。","textEn":"Before delivery calibrate each actuator's force-versus-command curve and hysteresis against a reference load cell; after installation perform force-sum checks in which the measured forces minus the share of the defining points must equal W·cos z, log the deviation at several elevations, and track each actuator's difference from the model over the long term.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「軸向支撐：力分配、仰角載重與力精度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Axial support: force distribution, elevation load and force accuracy\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","主鏡越厚越好，薄鏡只是為了省錢而犧牲品質。","每支致動器出廠前以標準荷重元校正力對指令的曲線與遲滯。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","Thicker primaries are always better; thin mirrors merely trade quality for cost.","Before delivery calibrate each actuator's force-versus-command curve and hysteresis against a reference load cell."],"answer":2,"explanation":"每支致動器出廠前以標準荷重元校正力對指令的曲線與遲滯；安裝後做力總和檢查：各支量測力的總和扣除定義點分擔後必須等於 W·cos z，在多個仰角下記錄偏差，並長期追蹤每支的力值與模型預測之差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before delivery calibrate each actuator's force-versus-command curve and hysteresis against a reference load cell; after installation perform force-sum checks in which the measured forces minus the share of the defining points must equal W·cos z, log the deviation at several elevations, and track each actuator's difference from the model over the long term. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a469-v12-12","title":"軸向支撐：力分配、仰角載重與力精度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Axial support: force distribution, elevation load and force accuracy: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「150 支軸向致動器與荷重元」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “150 axial actuators and load cells” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"某支致動器的荷重元零點漂移 20 N 而未被發現，控制器以為力正確，鏡面在該處留下局部凸起，影像外圍出現不對稱光暈；若力總和與定義點載重持續偏離，代表有機械卡滯或定義點過載。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A load-cell zero drift of 20 N on one actuator goes unnoticed, the controller believes the force is correct, and the mirror develops a local bump there that shows up as an asymmetric halo around images; a persistent mismatch between the force sum and the defining-point loads signals mechanical sticking or an overloaded defining point. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：仰角改變時軸向分量按 cos z 減少，力設定點必須連續追隨。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: As elevation changes the axial component falls as cos z, and the force set points must follow continuously.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「主鏡致動器只要把位置控制到奈米級，力的大小無關緊要。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Primary-mirror actuators need only nanometre position control; force does not matter.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"某支致動器的荷重元零點漂移 20 N 而未被發現，控制器以為力正確，鏡面在該處留下局部凸起，影像外圍出現不對稱光暈；若力總和與定義點載重持續偏離，代表有機械卡滯或定義點過載。","textEn":"A load-cell zero drift of 20 N on one actuator goes unnoticed, the controller believes the force is correct, and the mirror develops a local bump there that shows up as an asymmetric halo around images; a persistent mismatch between the force sum and the defining-point loads signals mechanical sticking or an overloaded defining point.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「軸向支撐：力分配、仰角載重與力精度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Axial support: force distribution, elevation load and force accuracy\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["某支致動器的荷重元零點漂移 20 N 而未被發現，控制器以為力正確，鏡面在該處留下局部凸起，影像外圍出現不對稱光暈。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","使用低膨脹的 Zerodur 後，主鏡就不需要任何熱控制。"],"optionsEn":["A load-cell zero drift of 20 N on one actuator goes unnoticed, the controller believes the force is correct, and the mirror develops a local bump there that shows up as an asymmetric halo around images.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","With low-expansion Zerodur the primary needs no thermal control at all."],"answer":0,"explanation":"某支致動器的荷重元零點漂移 20 N 而未被發現，控制器以為力正確，鏡面在該處留下局部凸起，影像外圍出現不對稱光暈；若力總和與定義點載重持續偏離，代表有機械卡滯或定義點過載。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A load-cell zero drift of 20 N on one actuator goes unnoticed, the controller believes the force is correct, and the mirror develops a local bump there that shows up as an asymmetric halo around images; a persistent mismatch between the force sum and the defining-point loads signals mechanical sticking or an overloaded defining point. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a469-v12-13","title":"側向支撐、溫度梯度與鏡面熱慣性：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Lateral support, thermal gradients and mirror thermal inertia: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「側向支撐與鏡室熱環境」如何決定望遠鏡主鏡主動支撐的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Lateral supports and cell thermal environment” determines the key performance of “Active support of telescope primary mirrors”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"望遠鏡傾斜時，鏡重的 sin z 分量由黏在鏡緣的側向支撐墊承擔；側向力若不通過鏡子的質心平面就會產生彎矩，把像散壓進鏡面，因此側向支撐的位置與力分配必須與軸向力修正搭配設計。溫度則有兩種效應：穿過厚度的溫度梯度使鏡面整體彎曲，主要表現為離焦；Zerodur 熱膨脹係數的不均勻則在整體溫變下產生高階變形。此外鏡面比夜間空氣暖時會在表面形成湍流邊界層，所以白天要把鏡子預冷到預期的夜間溫度。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「側向支撐與鏡室熱環境」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"When the telescope tilts, the sin z component of the weight is carried by lateral pads bonded to the mirror edge; lateral forces that do not act through the plane of the centre of mass create bending moments that press astigmatism into the surface, so lateral-support placement and force sharing must be designed together with axial corrections. Temperature acts in two ways: a gradient through the thickness bends the whole mirror, mainly as defocus, while inhomogeneity of the Zerodur expansion coefficient produces higher-order deformation under uniform temperature change. A mirror warmer than the night air also grows a turbulent boundary layer above its surface, so it is pre-cooled during the day to the expected night temperature. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Lateral supports and cell thermal environment”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：穿厚度溫差 ΔT = 0.5 K、CTE α = 0.05 ppm/K、t = 0.175 m：曲率 κ = α·ΔT/t ≈ 1.4×10⁻⁷ m⁻¹，在半徑 4.1 m 的矢高變化 κa²/2 ≈ 1.2 µm，幾乎全是離焦，可由副鏡修正。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A through-thickness difference ΔT = 0.5 K with CTE α = 0.05 ppm/K and t = 0.175 m gives curvature κ = α·ΔT/t ≈ 1.4×10⁻⁷ m⁻¹ and a sag change κa²/2 ≈ 1.2 µm at 4.1 m radius, almost pure defocus that the secondary can correct.","failure":"常見誤解：「使用低膨脹的 Zerodur 後，主鏡就不需要任何熱控制。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"With low-expansion Zerodur the primary needs no thermal control at all.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「側向支撐與鏡室熱環境」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Lateral supports and cell thermal environment”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-13-k1","title":"側向支撐、溫度梯度與鏡面熱慣性","titleEn":"Lateral support, thermal gradients and mirror thermal inertia","text":"望遠鏡傾斜時，鏡重的 sin z 分量由黏在鏡緣的側向支撐墊承擔；側向力若不通過鏡子的質心平面就會產生彎矩，把像散壓進鏡面，因此側向支撐的位置與力分配必須與軸向力修正搭配設計。溫度則有兩種效應：穿過厚度的溫度梯度使鏡面整體彎曲，主要表現為離焦；Zerodur 熱膨脹係數的不均勻則在整體溫變下產生高階變形。","textEn":"When the telescope tilts, the sin z component of the weight is carried by lateral pads bonded to the mirror edge; lateral forces that do not act through the plane of the centre of mass create bending moments that press astigmatism into the surface, so lateral-support placement and force sharing must be designed together with axial corrections. Temperature acts in two ways: a gradient through the thickness bends the whole mirror, mainly as defocus, while inhomogeneity of the Zerodur expansion coefficient produces higher-order deformation under uniform temperature change.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：使用低膨脹的 Zerodur 後，主鏡就不需要任何熱控制。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: With low-expansion Zerodur the primary needs no thermal control at all. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「側向支撐、溫度梯度與鏡面熱慣性」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Lateral support, thermal gradients and mirror thermal inertia\" is correct?","options":["使用低膨脹的 Zerodur 後，主鏡就不需要任何熱控制。","望遠鏡傾斜時，鏡重的 sin z 分量由黏在鏡緣的側向支撐墊承擔。","主動光學感測器量得越快越好，曝光一秒就足夠。"],"optionsEn":["With low-expansion Zerodur the primary needs no thermal control at all.","When the telescope tilts, the sin z component of the weight is carried by lateral pads bonded to the mirror edge.","Faster is always better for the active-optics sensor; one-second exposures suffice."],"answer":1,"explanation":"望遠鏡傾斜時，鏡重的 sin z 分量由黏在鏡緣的側向支撐墊承擔；側向力若不通過鏡子的質心平面就會產生彎矩，把像散壓進鏡面，因此側向支撐的位置與力分配必須與軸向力修正搭配設計。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"When the telescope tilts, the sin z component of the weight is carried by lateral pads bonded to the mirror edge; lateral forces that do not act through the plane of the centre of mass create bending moments that press astigmatism into the surface, so lateral-support placement and force sharing must be designed together with axial corrections. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a469-v12-14","title":"側向支撐、溫度梯度與鏡面熱慣性：定量估算","titleEn":"Lateral support, thermal gradients and mirror thermal inertia: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「側向支撐與鏡室熱環境」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Lateral supports and cell thermal environment” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：穿厚度溫差 ΔT = 0.5 K、CTE α = 0.05 ppm/K、t = 0.175 m：曲率 κ = α·ΔT/t ≈ 1.4×10⁻⁷ m⁻¹，在半徑 4.1 m 的矢高變化 κa²/2 ≈ 1.2 µm，幾乎全是離焦，可由副鏡修正。熱時間常數 τ ≈ ρ·c·t/h：c = 821 J/(kg·K)、自然對流 h ≈ 5 W/(m²·K) 時 τ ≈ 20 h，強制通風 h ≈ 15 W/(m²·K) 時約 6.7 h，鏡溫跟不上一夜的氣溫下降。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A through-thickness difference ΔT = 0.5 K with CTE α = 0.05 ppm/K and t = 0.175 m gives curvature κ = α·ΔT/t ≈ 1.4×10⁻⁷ m⁻¹ and a sag change κa²/2 ≈ 1.2 µm at 4.1 m radius, almost pure defocus that the secondary can correct. The thermal time constant τ ≈ ρ·c·t/h with c = 821 J/(kg·K) is about 20 h for natural convection h ≈ 5 W/(m²·K) and about 6.7 h with forced ventilation h ≈ 15 W/(m²·K), so the mirror cannot follow the night-time air-temperature fall. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在鏡背與鏡面附近佈設溫度感測器，記錄鏡體與圓頂空氣的溫差及穿厚度梯度，並與主動光學量到的離焦與高階模態係數對時間作相關；側向支撐則在不同天頂角比較像散係數，確認其隨 sin z 的變化已被軸向力表格抵消。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Install temperature sensors at the back and near the face of the mirror, log the mirror-to-dome-air difference and the through-thickness gradient, and correlate them in time with the defocus and higher-order mode coefficients from active optics; for lateral support compare astigmatism coefficients at several zenith angles and confirm that their sin z dependence is cancelled by the axial force tables.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"穿厚度溫差 ΔT = 0.5 K、CTE α = 0.05 ppm/K、t = 0.175 m：曲率 κ = α·ΔT/t ≈ 1.4×10⁻⁷ m⁻¹，在半徑 4.1 m 的矢高變化 κa²/2 ≈ 1.2 µm，幾乎全是離焦，可由副鏡修正。熱時間常數 τ ≈ ρ·c·t/h：c = 821 J/(kg·K)、自然對流 h ≈ 5 W/(m²·K) 時 τ ≈ 20 h，強制通風 h ≈ 15 W/(m²·K) 時約 6.7 h，鏡溫跟不上一夜的氣溫下降。","textEn":"A through-thickness difference ΔT = 0.5 K with CTE α = 0.05 ppm/K and t = 0.175 m gives curvature κ = α·ΔT/t ≈ 1.4×10⁻⁷ m⁻¹ and a sag change κa²/2 ≈ 1.2 µm at 4.1 m radius, almost pure defocus that the secondary can correct. The thermal time constant τ ≈ ρ·c·t/h with c = 821 J/(kg·K) is about 20 h for natural convection h ≈ 5 W/(m²·K) and about 6.7 h with forced ventilation h ≈ 15 W/(m²·K), so the mirror cannot follow the night-time air-temperature fall.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「側向支撐、溫度梯度與鏡面熱慣性」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Lateral support, thermal gradients and mirror thermal inertia\", which statement holds?","options":["只要有閉迴路修正，開迴路查找表就沒有用處。","主鏡越厚越好，薄鏡只是為了省錢而犧牲品質。","穿厚度溫差 ΔT = 0.5 K、CTE α = 0.05 ppm/K、t = 0.175 m：曲率 κ = α·ΔT/t ≈ 1.4×10⁻⁷ m⁻¹，在半徑 4.1 m 的矢高變化 κa²/2 ≈ 1.2 µm，幾乎全是離焦，可由副鏡修正。"],"optionsEn":["With closed-loop correction available, open-loop look-up tables are useless.","Thicker primaries are always better; thin mirrors merely trade quality for cost.","A through-thickness difference ΔT = 0.5 K with CTE α = 0.05 ppm/K and t = 0.175 m gives curvature κ = α·ΔT/t ≈ 1.4×10⁻⁷ m⁻¹ and a sag change κa²/2 ≈ 1.2 µm at 4.1 m radius, almost pure defocus that the secondary can correct."],"answer":2,"explanation":"穿厚度溫差 ΔT = 0.5 K、CTE α = 0.05 ppm/K、t = 0.175 m：曲率 κ = α·ΔT/t ≈ 1.4×10⁻⁷ m⁻¹，在半徑 4.1 m 的矢高變化 κa²/2 ≈ 1.2 µm，幾乎全是離焦，可由副鏡修正。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A through-thickness difference ΔT = 0.5 K with CTE α = 0.05 ppm/K and t = 0.175 m gives curvature κ = α·ΔT/t ≈ 1.4×10⁻⁷ m⁻¹ and a sag change κa²/2 ≈ 1.2 µm at 4.1 m radius, almost pure defocus that the secondary can correct. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a469-v12-15","title":"側向支撐、溫度梯度與鏡面熱慣性：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Lateral support, thermal gradients and mirror thermal inertia: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「側向支撐與鏡室熱環境」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Lateral supports and cell thermal environment” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在鏡背與鏡面附近佈設溫度感測器，記錄鏡體與圓頂空氣的溫差及穿厚度梯度，並與主動光學量到的離焦與高階模態係數對時間作相關；側向支撐則在不同天頂角比較像散係數，確認其隨 sin z 的變化已被軸向力表格抵消。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Install temperature sensors at the back and near the face of the mirror, log the mirror-to-dome-air difference and the through-thickness gradient, and correlate them in time with the defocus and higher-order mode coefficients from active optics; for lateral support compare astigmatism coefficients at several zenith angles and confirm that their sin z dependence is cancelled by the axial force tables. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：預冷不足時鏡面比空氣暖 2 到 3 K，整夜出現隨時間緩慢改善的鏡面視寧度，影像變寬卻被誤判為大氣條件差；側向支撐力分配錯誤時，像散係數隨天頂角系統性變化，主動光學每次換目標都在追同一個誤差。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: With inadequate pre-cooling the mirror runs 2 to 3 K warmer than the air, producing mirror seeing that slowly improves through the night and broadens images that are then blamed on the atmosphere; with mis-shared lateral forces astigmatism varies systematically with zenith angle and active optics chases the same error after every slew.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在鏡背與鏡面附近佈設溫度感測器，記錄鏡體與圓頂空氣的溫差及穿厚度梯度，並與主動光學量到的離焦與高階模態係數對時間作相關；側向支撐則在不同天頂角比較像散係數，確認其隨 sin z 的變化已被軸向力表格抵消。","textEn":"Install temperature sensors at the back and near the face of the mirror, log the mirror-to-dome-air difference and the through-thickness gradient, and correlate them in time with the defocus and higher-order mode coefficients from active optics; for lateral support compare astigmatism coefficients at several zenith angles and confirm that their sin z dependence is cancelled by the axial force tables.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「側向支撐、溫度梯度與鏡面熱慣性」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Lateral support, thermal gradients and mirror thermal inertia\"?","options":["在鏡背與鏡面附近佈設溫度感測器，記錄鏡體與圓頂空氣的溫差及穿厚度梯度，並與主動光學量到的離焦與高階模態係數對時間作相關。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","主動光學和自適應光學一樣，可以即時修正大氣湍流。"],"optionsEn":["Install temperature sensors at the back and near the face of the mirror, log the mirror-to-dome-air difference and the through-thickness gradient, and correlate them in time with the defocus and higher-order mode coefficients from active optics.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Active optics, like adaptive optics, corrects atmospheric turbulence in real time."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在鏡背與鏡面附近佈設溫度感測器，記錄鏡體與圓頂空氣的溫差及穿厚度梯度，並與主動光學量到的離焦與高階模態係數對時間作相關；側向支撐則在不同天頂角比較像散係數，確認其隨 sin z 的變化已被軸向力表格抵消。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Install temperature sensors at the back and near the face of the mirror, log the mirror-to-dome-air difference and the through-thickness gradient, and correlate them in time with the defocus and higher-order mode coefficients from active optics; for lateral support compare astigmatism coefficients at several zenith angles and confirm that their sin z dependence is cancelled by the axial force tables. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a469-v12-16","title":"側向支撐、溫度梯度與鏡面熱慣性：失效診斷","titleEn":"Lateral support, thermal gradients and mirror thermal inertia: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「側向支撐與鏡室熱環境」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Lateral supports and cell thermal environment” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"預冷不足時鏡面比空氣暖 2 到 3 K，整夜出現隨時間緩慢改善的鏡面視寧度，影像變寬卻被誤判為大氣條件差；側向支撐力分配錯誤時，像散係數隨天頂角系統性變化，主動光學每次換目標都在追同一個誤差。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"With inadequate pre-cooling the mirror runs 2 to 3 K warmer than the air, producing mirror seeing that slowly improves through the night and broadens images that are then blamed on the atmosphere; with mis-shared lateral forces astigmatism varies systematically with zenith angle and active optics chases the same error after every slew. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：此外鏡面比夜間空氣暖時會在表面形成湍流邊界層，所以白天要把鏡子預冷到預期的夜間溫度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A mirror warmer than the night air also grows a turbulent boundary layer above its surface, so it is pre-cooled during the day to the expected night temperature.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「使用低膨脹的 Zerodur 後，主鏡就不需要任何熱控制。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"With low-expansion Zerodur the primary needs no thermal control at all.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"預冷不足時鏡面比空氣暖 2 到 3 K，整夜出現隨時間緩慢改善的鏡面視寧度，影像變寬卻被誤判為大氣條件差；側向支撐力分配錯誤時，像散係數隨天頂角系統性變化，主動光學每次換目標都在追同一個誤差。","textEn":"With inadequate pre-cooling the mirror runs 2 to 3 K warmer than the air, producing mirror seeing that slowly improves through the night and broadens images that are then blamed on the atmosphere; with mis-shared lateral forces astigmatism varies systematically with zenith angle and active optics chases the same error after every slew.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「側向支撐、溫度梯度與鏡面熱慣性」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Lateral support, thermal gradients and mirror thermal inertia\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","預冷不足時鏡面比空氣暖 2 到 3 K，整夜出現隨時間緩慢改善的鏡面視寧度，影像變寬卻被誤判為大氣條件差。","主動光學感測器量得越快越好，曝光一秒就足夠。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","With inadequate pre-cooling the mirror runs 2 to 3 K warmer than the air, producing mirror seeing that slowly improves through the night and broadens images that are then blamed on the atmosphere.","Faster is always better for the active-optics sensor; one-second exposures suffice."],"answer":1,"explanation":"預冷不足時鏡面比空氣暖 2 到 3 K，整夜出現隨時間緩慢改善的鏡面視寧度，影像變寬卻被誤判為大氣條件差；側向支撐力分配錯誤時，像散係數隨天頂角系統性變化，主動光學每次換目標都在追同一個誤差。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"With inadequate pre-cooling the mirror runs 2 to 3 K warmer than the air, producing mirror seeing that slowly improves through the night and broadens images that are then blamed on the atmosphere; with mis-shared lateral forces astigmatism varies systematically with zenith angle and active optics chases the same error after every slew. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a469-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「波前感測：積分時間、視寧度平均與模態估計」與「校正矩陣、模態截斷與面形誤差預算」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Wavefront sensing: integration time, seeing averaging and modal estimation\" and \"Calibration matrix, modal truncation and the figure-error budget\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a469-v12-17","title":"波前感測：積分時間、視寧度平均與模態估計：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Wavefront sensing: integration time, seeing averaging and modal estimation: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「Shack–Hartmann 主動光學感測器」如何決定望遠鏡主鏡主動支撐的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Active-optics Shack–Hartmann sensor” determines the key performance of “Active support of telescope primary mirrors”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"主動光學的波前感測器裝在導引探頭中，以視場邊緣的一顆星做 Shack–Hartmann 量測：微透鏡陣列把瞳面切成子孔徑，每個光點的位移正比於該處的局部波前斜率。因為要量的是鏡面而不是大氣，曝光必須長到把湍流造成的光點隨機抖動平均掉，VLT 以約 30 秒積分、約每分鐘修正一次。量到的斜率再以最小平方法投影到主鏡彎曲模態與副鏡的離焦、彗差，換算成力與位置修正量。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「Shack–Hartmann 主動光學感測器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The active-optics wavefront sensor sits in the guide probe and makes a Shack–Hartmann measurement on a star at the edge of the field: a lenslet array divides the pupil into subapertures, and each spot's displacement is proportional to the local wavefront slope. Because the target is the mirror and not the atmosphere, exposures must be long enough to average out turbulence-induced spot jitter, so the VLT integrates for about 30 s and corrects roughly once a minute. The measured slopes are projected by least squares onto the primary's bending modes and the secondary's defocus and coma, then converted into force and position corrections. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Active-optics Shack–Hartmann sensor”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：假設 20×20 子孔徑，d = 8.2/20 = 0.41 m，r₀ = 0.15 m（500 nm）：單軸傾斜方差 σ² ≈ 0.17(λ/d)²(d/r₀)^(5/3)，σ ≈ 1.16 µrad ≈ 0.24″。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Assume 20×20 subapertures, d = 8.2/20 = 0.41 m and r₀ = 0.15 m at 500 nm: the one-axis tilt variance σ² ≈ 0.17(λ/d)²(d/r₀)^(5/3) gives σ ≈ 1.16 µrad ≈ 0.24″.","failure":"常見誤解：「主動光學感測器量得越快越好，曝光一秒就足夠。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Faster is always better for the active-optics sensor; one-second exposures suffice.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「Shack–Hartmann 主動光學感測器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Active-optics Shack–Hartmann sensor”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-17-k1","title":"波前感測：積分時間、視寧度平均與模態估計","titleEn":"Wavefront sensing: integration time, seeing averaging and modal estimation","text":"主動光學的波前感測器裝在導引探頭中，以視場邊緣的一顆星做 Shack–Hartmann 量測：微透鏡陣列把瞳面切成子孔徑，每個光點的位移正比於該處的局部波前斜率。因為要量的是鏡面而不是大氣，曝光必須長到把湍流造成的光點隨機抖動平均掉，VLT 以約 30 秒積分、約每分鐘修正一次。","textEn":"The active-optics wavefront sensor sits in the guide probe and makes a Shack–Hartmann measurement on a star at the edge of the field: a lenslet array divides the pupil into subapertures, and each spot's displacement is proportional to the local wavefront slope. Because the target is the mirror and not the atmosphere, exposures must be long enough to average out turbulence-induced spot jitter, so the VLT integrates for about 30 s and corrects roughly once a minute.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：主動光學感測器量得越快越好，曝光一秒就足夠。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Faster is always better for the active-optics sensor; one-second exposures suffice. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「波前感測：積分時間、視寧度平均與模態估計」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Wavefront sensing: integration time, seeing averaging and modal estimation\" is correct?","options":["主動光學感測器量得越快越好，曝光一秒就足夠。","致動器越多、修正的模態越多，殘差就一定越小。","主動光學的波前感測器裝在導引探頭中，以視場邊緣的一顆星做 Shack–Hartmann 量測：微透鏡陣列把瞳面切成子孔徑，每個光點的位移正比於該處的局部波前斜率。"],"optionsEn":["Faster is always better for the active-optics sensor; one-second exposures suffice.","More actuators and more corrected modes always mean smaller residuals.","The active-optics wavefront sensor sits in the guide probe and makes a Shack–Hartmann measurement on a star at the edge of the field: a lenslet array divides the pupil into subapertures, and each spot's displacement is proportional to the local wavefront slope."],"answer":2,"explanation":"主動光學的波前感測器裝在導引探頭中，以視場邊緣的一顆星做 Shack–Hartmann 量測：微透鏡陣列把瞳面切成子孔徑，每個光點的位移正比於該處的局部波前斜率。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The active-optics wavefront sensor sits in the guide probe and makes a Shack–Hartmann measurement on a star at the edge of the field: a lenslet array divides the pupil into subapertures, and each spot's displacement is proportional to the local wavefront slope. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a469-v12-18","title":"波前感測：積分時間、視寧度平均與模態估計：定量估算","titleEn":"Wavefront sensing: integration time, seeing averaging and modal estimation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「Shack–Hartmann 主動光學感測器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Active-optics Shack–Hartmann sensor” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：假設 20×20 子孔徑，d = 8.2/20 = 0.41 m，r₀ = 0.15 m（500 nm）：單軸傾斜方差 σ² ≈ 0.17(λ/d)²(d/r₀)^(5/3)，σ ≈ 1.16 µrad ≈ 0.24″。風速 10 m/s 時子孔徑傾斜相關時間約 d/v ≈ 0.041 s，30 s 內約 730 個獨立樣本，平均後 σ ≈ 0.24/√730 ≈ 0.009″，乘以 d 約為 18 nm 的子孔徑波前傾斜。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Assume 20×20 subapertures, d = 8.2/20 = 0.41 m and r₀ = 0.15 m at 500 nm: the one-axis tilt variance σ² ≈ 0.17(λ/d)²(d/r₀)^(5/3) gives σ ≈ 1.16 µrad ≈ 0.24″. With a 10 m/s wind the subaperture tilt correlation time is about d/v ≈ 0.041 s, giving about 730 independent samples in 30 s, so averaging leaves σ ≈ 0.24/√730 ≈ 0.009″, about 18 nm of wavefront tilt across a subaperture. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：先以內部參考光源校正感測器零點，也就是每個光點的參考位置；再對同一顆星以不同積分時間重複量測，畫模態係數的標準差對積分時間的曲線，應按 1/√T 下降直到量測雜訊底；並以已知的副鏡離焦偏移檢查重建係數的增益是否為 1。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: First calibrate the sensor zero point, the reference position of every spot, with an internal reference source; then repeat measurements on one star at several integration times and plot the standard deviation of mode coefficients versus integration time, which should fall as 1/√T down to the measurement-noise floor; finally inject a known secondary-mirror defocus offset to check that the reconstruction gain is unity.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"假設 20×20 子孔徑，d = 8.2/20 = 0.41 m，r₀ = 0.15 m（500 nm）：單軸傾斜方差 σ² ≈ 0.17(λ/d)²(d/r₀)^(5/3)，σ ≈ 1.16 µrad ≈ 0.24″。風速 10 m/s 時子孔徑傾斜相關時間約 d/v ≈ 0.041 s，30 s 內約 730 個獨立樣本，平均後 σ ≈ 0.24/√730 ≈ 0.009″，乘以 d 約為 18 nm 的子孔徑波前傾斜。","textEn":"Assume 20×20 subapertures, d = 8.2/20 = 0.41 m and r₀ = 0.15 m at 500 nm: the one-axis tilt variance σ² ≈ 0.17(λ/d)²(d/r₀)^(5/3) gives σ ≈ 1.16 µrad ≈ 0.24″. With a 10 m/s wind the subaperture tilt correlation time is about d/v ≈ 0.041 s, giving about 730 independent samples in 30 s, so averaging leaves σ ≈ 0.24/√730 ≈ 0.009″, about 18 nm of wavefront tilt across a subaperture.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「波前感測：積分時間、視寧度平均與模態估計」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Wavefront sensing: integration time, seeing averaging and modal estimation\", which statement holds?","options":["假設 20×20 子孔徑，d = 8.2/20 = 0.41 m，r₀ = 0.15 m（500 nm）：單軸傾斜方差 σ² ≈ 0.17(λ/d)²(d/r₀)^(5/3)，σ ≈ 1.16 µrad ≈ 0.24″。","只要影像品質合格，主鏡支撐系統就一定健康。","主動光學和自適應光學一樣，可以即時修正大氣湍流。"],"optionsEn":["Assume 20×20 subapertures, d = 8.2/20 = 0.41 m and r₀ = 0.15 m at 500 nm: the one-axis tilt variance σ² ≈ 0.17(λ/d)²(d/r₀)^(5/3) gives σ ≈ 1.16 µrad ≈ 0.24″.","If image quality passes, the primary support system must be healthy.","Active optics, like adaptive optics, corrects atmospheric turbulence in real time."],"answer":0,"explanation":"假設 20×20 子孔徑，d = 8.2/20 = 0.41 m，r₀ = 0.15 m（500 nm）：單軸傾斜方差 σ² ≈ 0.17(λ/d)²(d/r₀)^(5/3)，σ ≈ 1.16 µrad ≈ 0.24″。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Assume 20×20 subapertures, d = 8.2/20 = 0.41 m and r₀ = 0.15 m at 500 nm: the one-axis tilt variance σ² ≈ 0.17(λ/d)²(d/r₀)^(5/3) gives σ ≈ 1.16 µrad ≈ 0.24″. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a469-v12-19","title":"波前感測：積分時間、視寧度平均與模態估計：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Wavefront sensing: integration time, seeing averaging and modal estimation: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「Shack–Hartmann 主動光學感測器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Active-optics Shack–Hartmann sensor” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"先以內部參考光源校正感測器零點，也就是每個光點的參考位置；再對同一顆星以不同積分時間重複量測，畫模態係數的標準差對積分時間的曲線，應按 1/√T 下降直到量測雜訊底；並以已知的副鏡離焦偏移檢查重建係數的增益是否為 1。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"First calibrate the sensor zero point, the reference position of every spot, with an internal reference source; then repeat measurements on one star at several integration times and plot the standard deviation of mode coefficients versus integration time, which should fall as 1/√T down to the measurement-noise floor; finally inject a known secondary-mirror defocus offset to check that the reconstruction gain is unity. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若積分只有幾秒，殘留的大氣像差被當成鏡面誤差送進致動器，主鏡每次修正都在追隨機雜訊，面形越修越差；參考零點若隨溫度漂移，則會穩定地把一個不存在的像差寫進鏡面。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: With only a few seconds of integration, residual atmospheric aberration is mistaken for mirror error and sent to the actuators, so each correction chases random noise and the figure degrades; a reference zero point that drifts with temperature steadily writes a non-existent aberration into the mirror.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"先以內部參考光源校正感測器零點，也就是每個光點的參考位置；再對同一顆星以不同積分時間重複量測，畫模態係數的標準差對積分時間的曲線，應按 1/√T 下降直到量測雜訊底；並以已知的副鏡離焦偏移檢查重建係數的增益是否為 1。","textEn":"First calibrate the sensor zero point, the reference position of every spot, with an internal reference source; then repeat measurements on one star at several integration times and plot the standard deviation of mode coefficients versus integration time, which should fall as 1/√T down to the measurement-noise floor; finally inject a known secondary-mirror defocus offset to check that the reconstruction gain is unity.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「波前感測：積分時間、視寧度平均與模態估計」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Wavefront sensing: integration time, seeing averaging and modal estimation\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","先以內部參考光源校正感測器零點，也就是每個光點的參考位置。","主鏡致動器只要把位置控制到奈米級，力的大小無關緊要。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","First calibrate the sensor zero point, the reference position of every spot, with an internal reference source.","Primary-mirror actuators need only nanometre position control; force does not matter."],"answer":1,"explanation":"先以內部參考光源校正感測器零點，也就是每個光點的參考位置；再對同一顆星以不同積分時間重複量測，畫模態係數的標準差對積分時間的曲線，應按 1/√T 下降直到量測雜訊底；並以已知的副鏡離焦偏移檢查重建係數的增益是否為 1。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"First calibrate the sensor zero point, the reference position of every spot, with an internal reference source; then repeat measurements on one star at several integration times and plot the standard deviation of mode coefficients versus integration time, which should fall as 1/√T down to the measurement-noise floor; finally inject a known secondary-mirror defocus offset to check that the reconstruction gain is unity. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a469-v12-20","title":"波前感測：積分時間、視寧度平均與模態估計：失效診斷","titleEn":"Wavefront sensing: integration time, seeing averaging and modal estimation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「Shack–Hartmann 主動光學感測器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Active-optics Shack–Hartmann sensor” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若積分只有幾秒，殘留的大氣像差被當成鏡面誤差送進致動器，主鏡每次修正都在追隨機雜訊，面形越修越差；參考零點若隨溫度漂移，則會穩定地把一個不存在的像差寫進鏡面。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"With only a few seconds of integration, residual atmospheric aberration is mistaken for mirror error and sent to the actuators, so each correction chases random noise and the figure degrades; a reference zero point that drifts with temperature steadily writes a non-existent aberration into the mirror. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：量到的斜率再以最小平方法投影到主鏡彎曲模態與副鏡的離焦、彗差，換算成力與位置修正量。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The measured slopes are projected by least squares onto the primary's bending modes and the secondary's defocus and coma, then converted into force and position corrections.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「主動光學感測器量得越快越好，曝光一秒就足夠。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Faster is always better for the active-optics sensor; one-second exposures suffice.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若積分只有幾秒，殘留的大氣像差被當成鏡面誤差送進致動器，主鏡每次修正都在追隨機雜訊，面形越修越差；參考零點若隨溫度漂移，則會穩定地把一個不存在的像差寫進鏡面。","textEn":"With only a few seconds of integration, residual atmospheric aberration is mistaken for mirror error and sent to the actuators, so each correction chases random noise and the figure degrades; a reference zero point that drifts with temperature steadily writes a non-existent aberration into the mirror.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「波前感測：積分時間、視寧度平均與模態估計」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Wavefront sensing: integration time, seeing averaging and modal estimation\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","致動器越多、修正的模態越多，殘差就一定越小。","若積分只有幾秒，殘留的大氣像差被當成鏡面誤差送進致動器，主鏡每次修正都在追隨機雜訊，面形越修越差；參考零點若隨溫度漂移，則會穩定地把一個不存在的像差寫進鏡面。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","More actuators and more corrected modes always mean smaller residuals.","With only a few seconds of integration, residual atmospheric aberration is mistaken for mirror error and sent to the actuators, so each correction chases random noise and the figure degrades."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若積分只有幾秒，殘留的大氣像差被當成鏡面誤差送進致動器，主鏡每次修正都在追隨機雜訊，面形越修越差；參考零點若隨溫度漂移，則會穩定地把一個不存在的像差寫進鏡面。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"With only a few seconds of integration, residual atmospheric aberration is mistaken for mirror error and sent to the actuators, so each correction chases random noise and the figure degrades; a reference zero point that drifts with temperature steadily writes a non-existent aberration into the mirror. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a469-v12-21","title":"校正矩陣、模態截斷與面形誤差預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Calibration matrix, modal truncation and the figure-error budget: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「影響矩陣與誤差預算表」如何決定望遠鏡主鏡主動支撐的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Influence matrix and error-budget table” determines the key performance of “Active support of telescope primary mirrors”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"主動光學的核心校正是影響矩陣，也就是每一支致動器或每一組模態力分佈對波前感測量測值的響應。控制器用矩陣的擬反把量到的模態係數轉成力修正，並截斷奇異值太小的模態，以免把雜訊放大。修正後的殘差要進入誤差預算：拋光殘差、支撐印痕、主動光學殘差、熱變形與風載各項以均方根相加，再換算成不同波長的 Strehl 或影像寬度，才能判斷主鏡是否滿足儀器需求。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「影響矩陣與誤差預算表」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The central calibration of active optics is the influence matrix, the response of the wavefront-sensor measurements to each actuator or each modal force pattern. The controller uses its pseudo-inverse to turn measured mode coefficients into force corrections, truncating modes with small singular values so that noise is not amplified. The corrected residual then enters the error budget: polishing residual, support print-through, active-optics residual, thermal deformation and wind load are added root-sum-square and converted into Strehl or image width at several wavelengths to judge whether the primary meets instrument needs. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Influence matrix and error-budget table”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：波前 RMS 預算（教學假設）：拋光 30 nm、支撐印痕 15 nm、主動光學殘差 25 nm、熱 20 nm、風載 15 nm，RSS = √(30² + 15² + 25² + 20² + 15²) ≈ 49 nm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Wavefront RMS budget (teaching assumption): polishing 30 nm, support print-through 15 nm, active-optics residual 25 nm, thermal 20 nm and wind 15 nm give RSS = √(30² + 15² + 25² + 20² + 15²) ≈ 49 nm.","failure":"常見誤解：「致動器越多、修正的模態越多，殘差就一定越小。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"More actuators and more corrected modes always mean smaller residuals.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「影響矩陣與誤差預算表」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Influence matrix and error-budget table”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-21-k1","title":"校正矩陣、模態截斷與面形誤差預算","titleEn":"Calibration matrix, modal truncation and the figure-error budget","text":"主動光學的核心校正是影響矩陣，也就是每一支致動器或每一組模態力分佈對波前感測量測值的響應。控制器用矩陣的擬反把量到的模態係數轉成力修正，並截斷奇異值太小的模態，以免把雜訊放大。","textEn":"The central calibration of active optics is the influence matrix, the response of the wavefront-sensor measurements to each actuator or each modal force pattern. The controller uses its pseudo-inverse to turn measured mode coefficients into force corrections, truncating modes with small singular values so that noise is not amplified.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：致動器越多、修正的模態越多，殘差就一定越小。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: More actuators and more corrected modes always mean smaller residuals. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「校正矩陣、模態截斷與面形誤差預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Calibration matrix, modal truncation and the figure-error budget\" is correct?","options":["主動光學的核心校正是影響矩陣，也就是每一支致動器或每一組模態力分佈對波前感測量測值的響應。","致動器越多、修正的模態越多，殘差就一定越小。","只要有閉迴路修正，開迴路查找表就沒有用處。"],"optionsEn":["The central calibration of active optics is the influence matrix, the response of the wavefront-sensor measurements to each actuator or each modal force pattern.","More actuators and more corrected modes always mean smaller residuals.","With closed-loop correction available, open-loop look-up tables are useless."],"answer":0,"explanation":"主動光學的核心校正是影響矩陣，也就是每一支致動器或每一組模態力分佈對波前感測量測值的響應。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The central calibration of active optics is the influence matrix, the response of the wavefront-sensor measurements to each actuator or each modal force pattern. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a469-v12-22","title":"校正矩陣、模態截斷與面形誤差預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Calibration matrix, modal truncation and the figure-error budget: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「影響矩陣與誤差預算表」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Influence matrix and error-budget table” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：波前 RMS 預算（教學假設）：拋光 30 nm、支撐印痕 15 nm、主動光學殘差 25 nm、熱 20 nm、風載 15 nm，RSS = √(30² + 15² + 25² + 20² + 15²) ≈ 49 nm。Strehl ≈ exp[−(2πσ/λ)²]：2.2 µm 約 0.98、1.0 µm 約 0.91、0.5 µm 約 0.69，表示此主鏡在近紅外自適應光學下幾乎不扣分，在可見光則已消耗可觀預算。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Wavefront RMS budget (teaching assumption): polishing 30 nm, support print-through 15 nm, active-optics residual 25 nm, thermal 20 nm and wind 15 nm give RSS = √(30² + 15² + 25² + 20² + 15²) ≈ 49 nm. Strehl ≈ exp[−(2πσ/λ)²] is about 0.98 at 2.2 µm, 0.91 at 1.0 µm and 0.69 at 0.5 µm, so this primary costs almost nothing behind near-infrared adaptive optics but consumes a sizeable budget in the visible. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：逐一施加已知振幅的單一模態，量測回推振幅，驗證矩陣增益與交叉耦合（應小於 5%）；開閉迴路交替並記錄每次修正後的殘差模態係數，取長期統計填入預算表，與設計值逐項比較，任何一項超出時追查來源。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Apply single modes of known amplitude one at a time and measure the recovered amplitude to verify matrix gain and cross-coupling, which should stay below 5%; alternate open and closed loop, log the residual mode coefficients after every correction, enter long-term statistics in the budget table, compare item by item with the design, and trace the source of any item that exceeds its allocation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"波前 RMS 預算（教學假設）：拋光 30 nm、支撐印痕 15 nm、主動光學殘差 25 nm、熱 20 nm、風載 15 nm，RSS = √(30² + 15² + 25² + 20² + 15²) ≈ 49 nm。Strehl ≈ exp[−(2πσ/λ)²]：2.2 µm 約 0.98、1.0 µm 約 0.91、0.5 µm 約 0.69，表示此主鏡在近紅外自適應光學下幾乎不扣分，在可見光則已消耗可觀預算。","textEn":"Wavefront RMS budget (teaching assumption): polishing 30 nm, support print-through 15 nm, active-optics residual 25 nm, thermal 20 nm and wind 15 nm give RSS = √(30² + 15² + 25² + 20² + 15²) ≈ 49 nm. Strehl ≈ exp[−(2πσ/λ)²] is about 0.98 at 2.2 µm, 0.91 at 1.0 µm and 0.69 at 0.5 µm, so this primary costs almost nothing behind near-infrared adaptive optics but consumes a sizeable budget in the visible.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「校正矩陣、模態截斷與面形誤差預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Calibration matrix, modal truncation and the figure-error budget\", which statement holds?","options":["主鏡越厚越好，薄鏡只是為了省錢而犧牲品質。","波前 RMS 預算（教學假設）：拋光 30 nm、支撐印痕 15 nm、主動光學殘差 25 nm、熱 20 nm、風載 15 nm，RSS = √(30² + 15² + 25² + 20² + 15²) ≈ 49 nm。","主鏡致動器只要把位置控制到奈米級，力的大小無關緊要。"],"optionsEn":["Thicker primaries are always better; thin mirrors merely trade quality for cost.","Wavefront RMS budget (teaching assumption): polishing 30 nm, support print-through 15 nm, active-optics residual 25 nm, thermal 20 nm and wind 15 nm give RSS = √(30² + 15² + 25² + 20² + 15²) ≈ 49 nm.","Primary-mirror actuators need only nanometre position control; force does not matter."],"answer":1,"explanation":"波前 RMS 預算（教學假設）：拋光 30 nm、支撐印痕 15 nm、主動光學殘差 25 nm、熱 20 nm、風載 15 nm，RSS = √(30² + 15² + 25² + 20² + 15²) ≈ 49 nm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Wavefront RMS budget (teaching assumption): polishing 30 nm, support print-through 15 nm, active-optics residual 25 nm, thermal 20 nm and wind 15 nm give RSS = √(30² + 15² + 25² + 20² + 15²) ≈ 49 nm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a469-v12-23","title":"校正矩陣、模態截斷與面形誤差預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Calibration matrix, modal truncation and the figure-error budget: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「影響矩陣與誤差預算表」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Influence matrix and error-budget table” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"逐一施加已知振幅的單一模態，量測回推振幅，驗證矩陣增益與交叉耦合（應小於 5%）；開閉迴路交替並記錄每次修正後的殘差模態係數，取長期統計填入預算表，與設計值逐項比較，任何一項超出時追查來源。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Apply single modes of known amplitude one at a time and measure the recovered amplitude to verify matrix gain and cross-coupling, which should stay below 5%; alternate open and closed loop, log the residual mode coefficients after every correction, enter long-term statistics in the budget table, compare item by item with the design, and trace the source of any item that exceeds its allocation. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：影響矩陣在拋光廠支撐上量得卻直接用在望遠鏡支撐上，兩者邊界條件不同，修正某模態時同時激發另一模態，迴路收斂變慢甚至在兩個模態之間振盪；預算表若混用表面誤差與波前誤差，反射加倍效應會讓影響被低估一半。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: An influence matrix measured on the polishing-shop support but applied on the telescope support has different boundary conditions, so correcting one mode excites another, convergence slows, or the loop oscillates between two modes; a budget that mixes surface and wavefront errors underestimates the impact by half because reflection doubles surface error.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"逐一施加已知振幅的單一模態，量測回推振幅，驗證矩陣增益與交叉耦合（應小於 5%）；開閉迴路交替並記錄每次修正後的殘差模態係數，取長期統計填入預算表，與設計值逐項比較，任何一項超出時追查來源。","textEn":"Apply single modes of known amplitude one at a time and measure the recovered amplitude to verify matrix gain and cross-coupling, which should stay below 5%; alternate open and closed loop, log the residual mode coefficients after every correction, enter long-term statistics in the budget table, compare item by item with the design, and trace the source of any item that exceeds its allocation.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「校正矩陣、模態截斷與面形誤差預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Calibration matrix, modal truncation and the figure-error budget\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","使用低膨脹的 Zerodur 後，主鏡就不需要任何熱控制。","逐一施加已知振幅的單一模態，量測回推振幅，驗證矩陣增益與交叉耦合（應小於 5%）。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","With low-expansion Zerodur the primary needs no thermal control at all.","Apply single modes of known amplitude one at a time and measure the recovered amplitude to verify matrix gain and cross-coupling, which should stay below 5%."],"answer":2,"explanation":"逐一施加已知振幅的單一模態，量測回推振幅，驗證矩陣增益與交叉耦合（應小於 5%）；開閉迴路交替並記錄每次修正後的殘差模態係數，取長期統計填入預算表，與設計值逐項比較，任何一項超出時追查來源。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Apply single modes of known amplitude one at a time and measure the recovered amplitude to verify matrix gain and cross-coupling, which should stay below 5%; alternate open and closed loop, log the residual mode coefficients after every correction, enter long-term statistics in the budget table, compare item by item with the design, and trace the source of any item that exceeds its allocation. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a469-v12-24","title":"校正矩陣、模態截斷與面形誤差預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Calibration matrix, modal truncation and the figure-error budget: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「影響矩陣與誤差預算表」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Influence matrix and error-budget table” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"影響矩陣在拋光廠支撐上量得卻直接用在望遠鏡支撐上，兩者邊界條件不同，修正某模態時同時激發另一模態，迴路收斂變慢甚至在兩個模態之間振盪；預算表若混用表面誤差與波前誤差，反射加倍效應會讓影響被低估一半。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"An influence matrix measured on the polishing-shop support but applied on the telescope support has different boundary conditions, so correcting one mode excites another, convergence slows, or the loop oscillates between two modes; a budget that mixes surface and wavefront errors underestimates the impact by half because reflection doubles surface error. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：修正後的殘差要進入誤差預算：拋光殘差、支撐印痕、主動光學殘差、熱變形與風載各項以均方根相加，再換算成不同波長的 Strehl 或影像寬度，才能判斷主鏡是否滿足儀器需求。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The corrected residual then enters the error budget: polishing residual, support print-through, active-optics residual, thermal deformation and wind load are added root-sum-square and converted into Strehl or image width at several wavelengths to judge whether the primary meets instrument needs.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「致動器越多、修正的模態越多，殘差就一定越小。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"More actuators and more corrected modes always mean smaller residuals.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"影響矩陣在拋光廠支撐上量得卻直接用在望遠鏡支撐上，兩者邊界條件不同，修正某模態時同時激發另一模態，迴路收斂變慢甚至在兩個模態之間振盪；預算表若混用表面誤差與波前誤差，反射加倍效應會讓影響被低估一半。","textEn":"An influence matrix measured on the polishing-shop support but applied on the telescope support has different boundary conditions, so correcting one mode excites another, convergence slows, or the loop oscillates between two modes; a budget that mixes surface and wavefront errors underestimates the impact by half because reflection doubles surface error.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「校正矩陣、模態截斷與面形誤差預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Calibration matrix, modal truncation and the figure-error budget\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["影響矩陣在拋光廠支撐上量得卻直接用在望遠鏡支撐上，兩者邊界條件不同，修正某模態時同時激發另一模態，迴路收斂變慢甚至在兩個模態之間振盪。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","只要有閉迴路修正，開迴路查找表就沒有用處。"],"optionsEn":["An influence matrix measured on the polishing-shop support but applied on the telescope support has different boundary conditions, so correcting one mode excites another, convergence slows, or the loop oscillates between two modes.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","With closed-loop correction available, open-loop look-up tables are useless."],"answer":0,"explanation":"影響矩陣在拋光廠支撐上量得卻直接用在望遠鏡支撐上，兩者邊界條件不同，修正某模態時同時激發另一模態，迴路收斂變慢甚至在兩個模態之間振盪；預算表若混用表面誤差與波前誤差，反射加倍效應會讓影響被低估一半。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An influence matrix measured on the polishing-shop support but applied on the telescope support has different boundary conditions, so correcting one mode excites another, convergence slows, or the loop oscillates between two modes; a budget that mixes surface and wavefront errors underestimates the impact by half because reflection doubles surface error. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a469-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「開迴路查找表、閉迴路修正與主副鏡分工」與「整合驗證、力圖監測與工程交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Open-loop tables, closed-loop correction and M1–M2 division of labour\" and \"Integrated validation, force-map monitoring and engineering handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a469-v12-25","title":"開迴路查找表、閉迴路修正與主副鏡分工：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Open-loop tables, closed-loop correction and M1–M2 division of labour: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「仰角查找表與副鏡六軸平台」如何決定望遠鏡主鏡主動支撐的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Elevation look-up table and M2 hexapod” determines the key performance of “Active support of telescope primary mirrors”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"每次換目標都沒有時間從零收斂，所以主動光學以開迴路查找表為基礎：依鏡筒仰角與溫度預測主鏡力分佈與副鏡位置，再用閉迴路量測逐步修正殘差。主鏡負責像散、三葉形、球差等彎曲模態，副鏡以位置移動修正離焦與彗差，兩者共用同一組感測資料但頻寬不同；VLT 另有最高約 1 Hz 的快速修正，只處理最低階項。查找表的品質決定了換目標後多久才能開始科學曝光。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「仰角查找表與副鏡六軸平台」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"There is no time to converge from scratch after every slew, so active optics starts from open-loop look-up tables that predict primary forces and secondary position from tube elevation and temperature, and then trims the residual with closed-loop measurements. The primary handles bending modes such as astigmatism, trefoil and spherical aberration, while the secondary corrects defocus and coma by moving, both sharing the same sensor data at different bandwidths; the VLT also runs fast corrections up to about 1 Hz for the lowest-order terms only. Table quality decides how soon after a slew science exposures can start. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Elevation look-up table and M2 hexapod”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：迴路增益 g = 0.3、每次修正間隔 45 s：殘差 e_n = (1 − g)ⁿ·e₀。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With loop gain g = 0.3 and 45 s between corrections, the residual follows e_n = (1 − g)ⁿ·e₀.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要有閉迴路修正，開迴路查找表就沒有用處。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"With closed-loop correction available, open-loop look-up tables are useless.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「仰角查找表與副鏡六軸平台」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Elevation look-up table and M2 hexapod”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-25-k1","title":"開迴路查找表、閉迴路修正與主副鏡分工","titleEn":"Open-loop tables, closed-loop correction and M1–M2 division of labour","text":"每次換目標都沒有時間從零收斂，所以主動光學以開迴路查找表為基礎：依鏡筒仰角與溫度預測主鏡力分佈與副鏡位置，再用閉迴路量測逐步修正殘差。主鏡負責像散、三葉形、球差等彎曲模態，副鏡以位置移動修正離焦與彗差，兩者共用同一組感測資料但頻寬不同；VLT 另有最高約 1 Hz 的快速修正，只處理最低階項。","textEn":"There is no time to converge from scratch after every slew, so active optics starts from open-loop look-up tables that predict primary forces and secondary position from tube elevation and temperature, and then trims the residual with closed-loop measurements. The primary handles bending modes such as astigmatism, trefoil and spherical aberration, while the secondary corrects defocus and coma by moving, both sharing the same sensor data at different bandwidths; the VLT also runs fast corrections up to about 1 Hz for the lowest-order terms only.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要有閉迴路修正，開迴路查找表就沒有用處。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: With closed-loop correction available, open-loop look-up tables are useless. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「開迴路查找表、閉迴路修正與主副鏡分工」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Open-loop tables, closed-loop correction and M1–M2 division of labour\" is correct?","options":["只要有閉迴路修正，開迴路查找表就沒有用處。","每次換目標都沒有時間從零收斂，所以主動光學以開迴路查找表為基礎：依鏡筒仰角與溫度預測主鏡力分佈與副鏡位置，再用閉迴路量測逐步修正殘差。","只要影像品質合格，主鏡支撐系統就一定健康。"],"optionsEn":["With closed-loop correction available, open-loop look-up tables are useless.","There is no time to converge from scratch after every slew, so active optics starts from open-loop look-up tables that predict primary forces and secondary position from tube elevation and temperature, and then trims the residual with closed-loop measurements.","If image quality passes, the primary support system must be healthy."],"answer":1,"explanation":"每次換目標都沒有時間從零收斂，所以主動光學以開迴路查找表為基礎：依鏡筒仰角與溫度預測主鏡力分佈與副鏡位置，再用閉迴路量測逐步修正殘差。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"There is no time to converge from scratch after every slew, so active optics starts from open-loop look-up tables that predict primary forces and secondary position from tube elevation and temperature, and then trims the residual with closed-loop measurements. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a469-v12-26","title":"開迴路查找表、閉迴路修正與主副鏡分工：定量估算","titleEn":"Open-loop tables, closed-loop correction and M1–M2 division of labour: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「仰角查找表與副鏡六軸平台」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Elevation look-up table and M2 hexapod” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：迴路增益 g = 0.3、每次修正間隔 45 s：殘差 e_n = (1 − g)ⁿ·e₀。初始誤差 500 nm、目標 30 nm 時 n = ln(30/500)/ln(0.7) ≈ 7.9，需 8 次約 6 分鐘；若查找表把初始誤差降到 100 nm，只需 ln(0.3)/ln(0.7) ≈ 3.4，即 4 次約 3 分鐘；把增益提高到 0.5 雖可減到 5 次，卻對量測雜訊更敏感。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With loop gain g = 0.3 and 45 s between corrections, the residual follows e_n = (1 − g)ⁿ·e₀. From 500 nm down to 30 nm, n = ln(30/500)/ln(0.7) ≈ 7.9, so 8 corrections or about 6 minutes; if the tables cut the initial error to 100 nm, only ln(0.3)/ln(0.7) ≈ 3.4, so 4 corrections or about 3 minutes; raising the gain to 0.5 shortens this to 5 corrections but makes the loop more sensitive to measurement noise. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在多個仰角與溫度下記錄閉迴路收斂後的力分佈與副鏡位置，擬合成仰角與溫度的函數以更新查找表；換目標後記錄前幾次修正的殘差序列，與 (1 − g)ⁿ 模型比較，確認收斂率與設定增益一致且沒有過衝。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record the converged closed-loop force distribution and secondary position at many elevations and temperatures and fit them as functions of elevation and temperature to update the tables; after each slew log the residual sequence of the first few corrections and compare it with the (1 − g)ⁿ model to confirm that the convergence rate matches the set gain without overshoot.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"迴路增益 g = 0.3、每次修正間隔 45 s：殘差 e_n = (1 − g)ⁿ·e₀。初始誤差 500 nm、目標 30 nm 時 n = ln(30/500)/ln(0.7) ≈ 7.9，需 8 次約 6 分鐘；若查找表把初始誤差降到 100 nm，只需 ln(0.3)/ln(0.7) ≈ 3.4，即 4 次約 3 分鐘；把增益提高到 0.5 雖可減到 5 次，卻對量測雜訊更敏感。","textEn":"With loop gain g = 0.3 and 45 s between corrections, the residual follows e_n = (1 − g)ⁿ·e₀. From 500 nm down to 30 nm, n = ln(30/500)/ln(0.7) ≈ 7.9, so 8 corrections or about 6 minutes; if the tables cut the initial error to 100 nm, only ln(0.3)/ln(0.7) ≈ 3.4, so 4 corrections or about 3 minutes; raising the gain to 0.5 shortens this to 5 corrections but makes the loop more sensitive to measurement noise.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「開迴路查找表、閉迴路修正與主副鏡分工」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Open-loop tables, closed-loop correction and M1–M2 division of labour\", which statement holds?","options":["主動光學和自適應光學一樣，可以即時修正大氣湍流。","使用低膨脹的 Zerodur 後，主鏡就不需要任何熱控制。","迴路增益 g = 0.3、每次修正間隔 45 s：殘差 e_n = (1 − g)ⁿ·e₀。"],"optionsEn":["Active optics, like adaptive optics, corrects atmospheric turbulence in real time.","With low-expansion Zerodur the primary needs no thermal control at all.","With loop gain g = 0.3 and 45 s between corrections, the residual follows e_n = (1 − g)ⁿ·e₀."],"answer":2,"explanation":"迴路增益 g = 0.3、每次修正間隔 45 s：殘差 e_n = (1 − g)ⁿ·e₀。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With loop gain g = 0.3 and 45 s between corrections, the residual follows e_n = (1 − g)ⁿ·e₀. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a469-v12-27","title":"開迴路查找表、閉迴路修正與主副鏡分工：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Open-loop tables, closed-loop correction and M1–M2 division of labour: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「仰角查找表與副鏡六軸平台」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Elevation look-up table and M2 hexapod” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在多個仰角與溫度下記錄閉迴路收斂後的力分佈與副鏡位置，擬合成仰角與溫度的函數以更新查找表；換目標後記錄前幾次修正的殘差序列，與 (1 − g)ⁿ 模型比較，確認收斂率與設定增益一致且沒有過衝。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record the converged closed-loop force distribution and secondary position at many elevations and temperatures and fit them as functions of elevation and temperature to update the tables; after each slew log the residual sequence of the first few corrections and compare it with the (1 − g)ⁿ model to confirm that the convergence rate matches the set gain without overshoot. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：更換致動器或重新鍍膜後未更新查找表，每次換目標都從大誤差開始，前幾分鐘的影像品質不合格；若主鏡與副鏡同時修正彗差而沒有明確分工，兩者會互相抵消並緩慢漂移，最後讓副鏡偏心超出行程。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Failing to update the tables after an actuator exchange or recoating means every slew starts from a large error and the first minutes of data fail image-quality limits; if primary and secondary both correct coma without a clear division, they cancel each other and drift slowly until the secondary decentre runs out of range.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在多個仰角與溫度下記錄閉迴路收斂後的力分佈與副鏡位置，擬合成仰角與溫度的函數以更新查找表；換目標後記錄前幾次修正的殘差序列，與 (1 − g)ⁿ 模型比較，確認收斂率與設定增益一致且沒有過衝。","textEn":"Record the converged closed-loop force distribution and secondary position at many elevations and temperatures and fit them as functions of elevation and temperature to update the tables; after each slew log the residual sequence of the first few corrections and compare it with the (1 − g)ⁿ model to confirm that the convergence rate matches the set gain without overshoot.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「開迴路查找表、閉迴路修正與主副鏡分工」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Open-loop tables, closed-loop correction and M1–M2 division of labour\"?","options":["在多個仰角與溫度下記錄閉迴路收斂後的力分佈與副鏡位置，擬合成仰角與溫度的函數以更新查找表。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","主動光學感測器量得越快越好，曝光一秒就足夠。"],"optionsEn":["Record the converged closed-loop force distribution and secondary position at many elevations and temperatures and fit them as functions of elevation and temperature to update the tables.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Faster is always better for the active-optics sensor; one-second exposures suffice."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在多個仰角與溫度下記錄閉迴路收斂後的力分佈與副鏡位置，擬合成仰角與溫度的函數以更新查找表；換目標後記錄前幾次修正的殘差序列，與 (1 − g)ⁿ 模型比較，確認收斂率與設定增益一致且沒有過衝。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record the converged closed-loop force distribution and secondary position at many elevations and temperatures and fit them as functions of elevation and temperature to update the tables; after each slew log the residual sequence of the first few corrections and compare it with the (1 − g)ⁿ model to confirm that the convergence rate matches the set gain without overshoot. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a469-v12-28","title":"開迴路查找表、閉迴路修正與主副鏡分工：失效診斷","titleEn":"Open-loop tables, closed-loop correction and M1–M2 division of labour: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「仰角查找表與副鏡六軸平台」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Elevation look-up table and M2 hexapod” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"更換致動器或重新鍍膜後未更新查找表，每次換目標都從大誤差開始，前幾分鐘的影像品質不合格；若主鏡與副鏡同時修正彗差而沒有明確分工，兩者會互相抵消並緩慢漂移，最後讓副鏡偏心超出行程。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Failing to update the tables after an actuator exchange or recoating means every slew starts from a large error and the first minutes of data fail image-quality limits; if primary and secondary both correct coma without a clear division, they cancel each other and drift slowly until the secondary decentre runs out of range. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：查找表的品質決定了換目標後多久才能開始科學曝光。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Table quality decides how soon after a slew science exposures can start.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要有閉迴路修正，開迴路查找表就沒有用處。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"With closed-loop correction available, open-loop look-up tables are useless.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"更換致動器或重新鍍膜後未更新查找表，每次換目標都從大誤差開始，前幾分鐘的影像品質不合格；若主鏡與副鏡同時修正彗差而沒有明確分工，兩者會互相抵消並緩慢漂移，最後讓副鏡偏心超出行程。","textEn":"Failing to update the tables after an actuator exchange or recoating means every slew starts from a large error and the first minutes of data fail image-quality limits; if primary and secondary both correct coma without a clear division, they cancel each other and drift slowly until the secondary decentre runs out of range.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「開迴路查找表、閉迴路修正與主副鏡分工」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Open-loop tables, closed-loop correction and M1–M2 division of labour\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","更換致動器或重新鍍膜後未更新查找表，每次換目標都從大誤差開始，前幾分鐘的影像品質不合格。","只要影像品質合格，主鏡支撐系統就一定健康。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Failing to update the tables after an actuator exchange or recoating means every slew starts from a large error and the first minutes of data fail image-quality limits.","If image quality passes, the primary support system must be healthy."],"answer":1,"explanation":"更換致動器或重新鍍膜後未更新查找表，每次換目標都從大誤差開始，前幾分鐘的影像品質不合格；若主鏡與副鏡同時修正彗差而沒有明確分工，兩者會互相抵消並緩慢漂移，最後讓副鏡偏心超出行程。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Failing to update the tables after an actuator exchange or recoating means every slew starts from a large error and the first minutes of data fail image-quality limits; if primary and secondary both correct coma without a clear division, they cancel each other and drift slowly until the secondary decentre runs out of range. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a469-v12-29","title":"整合驗證、力圖監測與工程交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Integrated validation, force-map monitoring and engineering handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「影像品質驗收與力圖監測」如何決定望遠鏡主鏡主動支撐的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Image-quality acceptance and force-map monitoring” determines the key performance of “Active support of telescope primary mirrors”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"主動支撐的驗收必須在望遠鏡上完成：在各仰角與溫度條件下量閉迴路後的模態殘差與影像寬度，把主鏡對總影像品質的貢獻從大氣、導星與儀器中分離出來。運轉後，力圖是主鏡健康最直接的紀錄：每支致動器的力歷史、力總和與重量的一致性、主動力是否逐漸逼近極限，都能提前揭露卡滯、荷重元漂移或支撐墊脫膠。交接文件需包含影響矩陣版本、查找表、各致動器校正係數與安全限值。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「影像品質驗收與力圖監測」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Acceptance of active support must happen on the telescope: measure closed-loop mode residuals and image width over elevation and temperature, separating the primary's contribution to total image quality from atmosphere, guide star and instrument. In operation the force map is the most direct record of mirror health: each actuator's force history, the agreement of the force sum with the weight, and whether active forces creep towards their limits all reveal sticking, load-cell drift or debonding pads early. The handoff file must hold the influence-matrix version, look-up tables, per-actuator calibration coefficients and safety limits. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Image-quality acceptance and force-map monitoring”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：力總和檢查：W = 226 kN，天頂角 30° 時軸向應為 W·cos 30° ≈ 195.7 kN；若允許 0.5% 偏差，相當於 ±0.98 kN，超出即告警。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Force-sum check: with W = 226 kN, the axial sum at 30° zenith angle should be W·cos 30° ≈ 195.7 kN; a 0.5% tolerance equals ±0.98 kN, beyond which an alarm is raised.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要影像品質合格，主鏡支撐系統就一定健康。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If image quality passes, the primary support system must be healthy.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「影像品質驗收與力圖監測」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Image-quality acceptance and force-map monitoring”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-29-k1","title":"整合驗證、力圖監測與工程交接","titleEn":"Integrated validation, force-map monitoring and engineering handoff","text":"主動支撐的驗收必須在望遠鏡上完成：在各仰角與溫度條件下量閉迴路後的模態殘差與影像寬度，把主鏡對總影像品質的貢獻從大氣、導星與儀器中分離出來。運轉後，力圖是主鏡健康最直接的紀錄：每支致動器的力歷史、力總和與重量的一致性、主動力是否逐漸逼近極限，都能提前揭露卡滯、荷重元漂移或支撐墊脫膠。","textEn":"Acceptance of active support must happen on the telescope: measure closed-loop mode residuals and image width over elevation and temperature, separating the primary's contribution to total image quality from atmosphere, guide star and instrument. In operation the force map is the most direct record of mirror health: each actuator's force history, the agreement of the force sum with the weight, and whether active forces creep towards their limits all reveal sticking, load-cell drift or debonding pads early.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要影像品質合格，主鏡支撐系統就一定健康。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If image quality passes, the primary support system must be healthy. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「整合驗證、力圖監測與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Integrated validation, force-map monitoring and engineering handoff\" is correct?","options":["只要影像品質合格，主鏡支撐系統就一定健康。","主鏡越厚越好，薄鏡只是為了省錢而犧牲品質。","主動支撐的驗收必須在望遠鏡上完成：在各仰角與溫度條件下量閉迴路後的模態殘差與影像寬度，把主鏡對總影像品質的貢獻從大氣、導星與儀器中分離出來。"],"optionsEn":["If image quality passes, the primary support system must be healthy.","Thicker primaries are always better; thin mirrors merely trade quality for cost.","Acceptance of active support must happen on the telescope: measure closed-loop mode residuals and image width over elevation and temperature, separating the primary's contribution to total image quality from atmosphere, guide star and instrument."],"answer":2,"explanation":"主動支撐的驗收必須在望遠鏡上完成：在各仰角與溫度條件下量閉迴路後的模態殘差與影像寬度，把主鏡對總影像品質的貢獻從大氣、導星與儀器中分離出來。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Acceptance of active support must happen on the telescope: measure closed-loop mode residuals and image width over elevation and temperature, separating the primary's contribution to total image quality from atmosphere, guide star and instrument. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a469-v12-30","title":"整合驗證、力圖監測與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Integrated validation, force-map monitoring and engineering handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「影像品質驗收與力圖監測」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Image-quality acceptance and force-map monitoring” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：力總和檢查：W = 226 kN，天頂角 30° 時軸向應為 W·cos 30° ≈ 195.7 kN；若允許 0.5% 偏差，相當於 ±0.98 kN，超出即告警。主動力趨勢：若某支致動器的主動力每月增加 3 N、距 ±120 N 預算還剩 60 N，約 20 個月後耗盡，必須排入下一次維護窗口。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Force-sum check: with W = 226 kN, the axial sum at 30° zenith angle should be W·cos 30° ≈ 195.7 kN; a 0.5% tolerance equals ±0.98 kN, beyond which an alarm is raised. Active-force trend: if one actuator's active force grows by 3 N per month with 60 N left before the ±120 N budget, it runs out in about 20 months and must be scheduled for the next maintenance window. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以天頂角 0°、30°、60° 的夜間測試記錄模態殘差、影像半高全寬與力總和，並與交接文件中的基準比對；每週自動產生力圖報告，列出偏離模型超過門檻的致動器與其趨勢，維護後重新量測影響函數確認修復。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Run night tests at 0°, 30° and 60° zenith angle recording mode residuals, image FWHM and force sums, and compare them with the baselines in the handoff file; generate a weekly force-map report listing actuators whose deviation from the model exceeds threshold together with their trends, and re-measure influence functions after maintenance to confirm the repair.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"力總和檢查：W = 226 kN，天頂角 30° 時軸向應為 W·cos 30° ≈ 195.7 kN；若允許 0.5% 偏差，相當於 ±0.98 kN，超出即告警。主動力趨勢：若某支致動器的主動力每月增加 3 N、距 ±120 N 預算還剩 60 N，約 20 個月後耗盡，必須排入下一次維護窗口。","textEn":"Force-sum check: with W = 226 kN, the axial sum at 30° zenith angle should be W·cos 30° ≈ 195.7 kN; a 0.5% tolerance equals ±0.98 kN, beyond which an alarm is raised. Active-force trend: if one actuator's active force grows by 3 N per month with 60 N left before the ±120 N budget, it runs out in about 20 months and must be scheduled for the next maintenance window.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「整合驗證、力圖監測與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Integrated validation, force-map monitoring and engineering handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["力總和檢查：W = 226 kN，天頂角 30° 時軸向應為 W·cos 30° ≈ 195.7 kN。","主鏡致動器只要把位置控制到奈米級，力的大小無關緊要。","主動光學感測器量得越快越好，曝光一秒就足夠。"],"optionsEn":["Force-sum check: with W = 226 kN, the axial sum at 30° zenith angle should be W·cos 30° ≈ 195.7 kN.","Primary-mirror actuators need only nanometre position control; force does not matter.","Faster is always better for the active-optics sensor; one-second exposures suffice."],"answer":0,"explanation":"力總和檢查：W = 226 kN，天頂角 30° 時軸向應為 W·cos 30° ≈ 195.7 kN；若允許 0.5% 偏差，相當於 ±0.98 kN，超出即告警。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Force-sum check: with W = 226 kN, the axial sum at 30° zenith angle should be W·cos 30° ≈ 195.7 kN; a 0.5% tolerance equals ±0.98 kN, beyond which an alarm is raised. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a469-v12-31","title":"整合驗證、力圖監測與工程交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Integrated validation, force-map monitoring and engineering handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「影像品質驗收與力圖監測」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Image-quality acceptance and force-map monitoring” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以天頂角 0°、30°、60° 的夜間測試記錄模態殘差、影像半高全寬與力總和，並與交接文件中的基準比對；每週自動產生力圖報告，列出偏離模型超過門檻的致動器與其趨勢，維護後重新量測影響函數確認修復。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Run night tests at 0°, 30° and 60° zenith angle recording mode residuals, image FWHM and force sums, and compare them with the baselines in the handoff file; generate a weekly force-map report listing actuators whose deviation from the model exceeds threshold together with their trends, and re-measure influence functions after maintenance to confirm the repair. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：某個側向支撐墊的黏膠逐漸失效，鏡子在高天頂角時微小位移並產生像散，主動光學以越來越大的力補償，影像品質表面上仍合格；直到力達極限才突然無法修正，若沒有趨勢監測，失效會在觀測夜中才被發現。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: The adhesive on one lateral pad slowly fails, the mirror shifts slightly at large zenith angles and develops astigmatism, and active optics compensates with ever larger forces while image quality still passes; only when forces hit their limits does correction suddenly fail, and without trend monitoring the fault appears in the middle of an observing night.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以天頂角 0°、30°、60° 的夜間測試記錄模態殘差、影像半高全寬與力總和，並與交接文件中的基準比對；每週自動產生力圖報告，列出偏離模型超過門檻的致動器與其趨勢，維護後重新量測影響函數確認修復。","textEn":"Run night tests at 0°, 30° and 60° zenith angle recording mode residuals, image FWHM and force sums, and compare them with the baselines in the handoff file; generate a weekly force-map report listing actuators whose deviation from the model exceeds threshold together with their trends, and re-measure influence functions after maintenance to confirm the repair.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「整合驗證、力圖監測與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Integrated validation, force-map monitoring and engineering handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以天頂角 0°、30°、60° 的夜間測試記錄模態殘差、影像半高全寬與力總和，並與交接文件中的基準比對。","致動器越多、修正的模態越多，殘差就一定越小。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Run night tests at 0°, 30° and 60° zenith angle recording mode residuals, image FWHM and force sums, and compare them with the baselines in the handoff file.","More actuators and more corrected modes always mean smaller residuals."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以天頂角 0°、30°、60° 的夜間測試記錄模態殘差、影像半高全寬與力總和，並與交接文件中的基準比對；每週自動產生力圖報告，列出偏離模型超過門檻的致動器與其趨勢，維護後重新量測影響函數確認修復。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Run night tests at 0°, 30° and 60° zenith angle recording mode residuals, image FWHM and force sums, and compare them with the baselines in the handoff file; generate a weekly force-map report listing actuators whose deviation from the model exceeds threshold together with their trends, and re-measure influence functions after maintenance to confirm the repair. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a469-v12-32","title":"整合驗證、力圖監測與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Integrated validation, force-map monitoring and engineering handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"prerequisiteIds":["a469-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「影像品質驗收與力圖監測」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Image-quality acceptance and force-map monitoring” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"某個側向支撐墊的黏膠逐漸失效，鏡子在高天頂角時微小位移並產生像散，主動光學以越來越大的力補償，影像品質表面上仍合格；直到力達極限才突然無法修正，若沒有趨勢監測，失效會在觀測夜中才被發現。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"The adhesive on one lateral pad slowly fails, the mirror shifts slightly at large zenith angles and develops astigmatism, and active optics compensates with ever larger forces while image quality still passes; only when forces hit their limits does correction suddenly fail, and without trend monitoring the fault appears in the middle of an observing night. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接文件需包含影響矩陣版本、查找表、各致動器校正係數與安全限值。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The handoff file must hold the influence-matrix version, look-up tables, per-actuator calibration coefficients and safety limits.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要影像品質合格，主鏡支撐系統就一定健康。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If image quality passes, the primary support system must be healthy.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a469-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"某個側向支撐墊的黏膠逐漸失效，鏡子在高天頂角時微小位移並產生像散，主動光學以越來越大的力補償，影像品質表面上仍合格；直到力達極限才突然無法修正，若沒有趨勢監測，失效會在觀測夜中才被發現。","textEn":"The adhesive on one lateral pad slowly fails, the mirror shifts slightly at large zenith angles and develops astigmatism, and active optics compensates with ever larger forces while image quality still passes; only when forces hit their limits does correction suddenly fail, and without trend monitoring the fault appears in the middle of an observing night.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]},{"id":"a469-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「整合驗證、力圖監測與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Integrated validation, force-map monitoring and engineering handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","主鏡越厚越好，薄鏡只是為了省錢而犧牲品質。","某個側向支撐墊的黏膠逐漸失效，鏡子在高天頂角時微小位移並產生像散，主動光學以越來越大的力補償，影像品質表面上仍合格。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Thicker primaries are always better; thin mirrors merely trade quality for cost.","The adhesive on one lateral pad slowly fails, the mirror shifts slightly at large zenith angles and develops astigmatism, and active optics compensates with ever larger forces while image quality still passes."],"answer":2,"explanation":"某個側向支撐墊的黏膠逐漸失效，鏡子在高天頂角時微小位移並產生像散，主動光學以越來越大的力補償，影像品質表面上仍合格；直到力達極限才突然無法修正，若沒有趨勢監測，失效會在觀測夜中才被發現。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"The adhesive on one lateral pad slowly fails, the mirror shifts slightly at large zenith angles and develops astigmatism, and active optics compensates with ever larger forces while image quality still passes; only when forces hit their limits does correction suddenly fail, and without trend monitoring the fault appears in the middle of an observing night. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-eso-vlt-active-optics-system","v12o-eso-vlt-primary-mirrors","v12o-eso-active-optics-public","v12o-noethe-active-optics-review"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
